:[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"A playful collection of 24 decorative geometric tiles with bold, symmetrical forms for websites, branding, patterns, posters, and creative layouts.\"}]}]},\"introduction\":\"24 Geometric Ornamental Shapes\",\"slug\":\"decorative-tiles\",\"author\":{\"framerUserId\":\"219b924e-40d7-4b1f-892f-3fbcc48a56e9\",\"name\":\"Misbachul Umam\",\"slug\":\"misbachulumam\",\"avatar\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/media/219b924e-40d7-4b1f-892f-3fbcc48a56e9/65mj5a5d\",\"followed\":false,\"followsYou\":false},\"media\":[{\"type\":\"image\",\"url\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/media/219b924e-40d7-4b1f-892f-3fbcc48a56e9/01a00357-1f22-729d-95cd-b23b064731a3.png\",\"metadata\":{\"tint\":\"hsl(180 13% 13%)\",\"aspectRatio\":1.3333333333333333}},{\"type\":\"image\",\"url\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/media/219b924e-40d7-4b1f-892f-3fbcc48a56e9/01a00357-2c62-70f8-95ba-d7cbd01fde70.png\",\"metadata\":{\"tint\":\"hsl(180 13% 13%)\",\"aspectRatio\":1.3333333333333333}}],\"post\":{\"id\":\"01a00357-98d8-7343-9087-1abe3278f36d\",\"bodyJson\":{\"type\":\"doc\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Introducing \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Decorative Tiles\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\", a collection of 24 geometric ornamental shapes made for playful, bold, and creative compositions. Perfect for websites, branding, patterns, posters, and Framer projects.\"}]}]},\"likes\":{\"count\":9,\"liked\":false},\"comments\":{\"count\":0},\"reposts\":{\"count\":0,\"reposted\":false,\"repostId\":null}},\"createdAt\":\"2026-08-15T02:54:27.041Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-08-15T02:54:27.041Z\",\"publishedAt\":\"2026-08-15T02:54:27.036Z\",\"featuredAt\":null,\"reported\":false,\"approvedAt\":null,\"type\":\"vector\",\"attributes\":{\"url\":null,\"price\":\"5\",\"paymentUrl\":\"https://misbachulumam.lemonsqueezy.com/checkout/buy/61b25fb7-692e-44fe-afab-b082e819cda2\",\"vectorCount\":24,\"categories\":[{\"id\":\"89c679b1-87fd-4d3a-830c-c029d9c86011\",\"name\":\"Shapes\",\"slug\":\"shapes\"}]}},{\"id\":\"sLCf7UbWDemr6kxsAw70\",\"resolved\":true,\"title\":\"Stars and Sparkles\",\"body\":\"\u003cp\u003eIncludes multiple star variations suitable for ratings, highlights, accents, Ai signs, and visual emphasis.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eAll icons are fully editable vectors: you can easily adjust size, stroke weight, corner radius, and colors directly in Framer.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eProduct Features\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eVector-based star icons\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eFully editable shapes and styles\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eAdjustable stroke and scale\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eEasy color customization\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eClean geometry, grid-aligned\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eOptimized for UI and web use\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\",\"bodyJson\":null,\"introduction\":\"A flexible set of star icons designed for modern UI and web layouts.\\n\",\"slug\":\"stars-and-sparkles\",\"author\":{\"framerUserId\":\"45c55f9e-cc72-4fee-bd30-059c3f46906c\",\"name\":\"Stacy More\",\"slug\":\"stacymore\",\"avatar\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/creators/795390/avatar-zCT1zzbyFssQ9c3PCPzsHSYbf8uD21.jpg\",\"followed\":false,\"followsYou\":false},\"media\":[{\"type\":\"image\",\"url\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/vector-sets/stars-and-sparkles/kosa56mf-MWlT7e9l5haJ7ndlSUM41UjSVdCy4Q\",\"metadata\":{\"tint\":\"hsl(268 94% 25%)\",\"aspectRatio\":1.3333333333333333}},{\"type\":\"image\",\"url\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/vector-sets/stars-and-sparkles/gpfd3ymx-bKGUP9Us5boYMBSbQkJrpjLKYoOlSy\",\"metadata\":{\"tint\":\"hsl(263 89% 14%)\",\"aspectRatio\":1.3333333333333333}},{\"type\":\"image\",\"url\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/vector-sets/stars-and-sparkles/xajg2fwe-r31nfPwZ1Ybifens4s7phAKLB6Qmp0\",\"metadata\":{\"tint\":\"hsl(268 94% 25%)\",\"aspectRatio\":1.3333333333333333}}],\"post\":{\"id\":\"019d2479-9c30-73e6-b933-1c806a4d4e5e\",\"bodyJson\":null,\"likes\":{\"count\":59,\"liked\":false},\"comments\":{\"count\":1},\"reposts\":{\"count\":0,\"reposted\":false,\"repostId\":null}},\"createdAt\":\"2026-03-20T12:18:12.144Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-03-25T10:10:42.864Z\",\"publishedAt\":\"2026-03-25T10:10:42.864Z\",\"featuredAt\":null,\"reported\":false,\"approvedAt\":null,\"type\":\"vector\",\"attributes\":{\"url\":\"https://framer.com/m/Basic-star-yHK2G8.js@4de8zk7NAM4XrBt6j1Rc\",\"price\":null,\"paymentUrl\":null,\"vectorCount\":33,\"categories\":[{\"id\":\"3535507e-b041-4f48-be7f-a084b14e30b2\",\"name\":\"Icons\",\"slug\":\"icons\"}]}},{\"id\":\"VYPWvqxciL8mpQtd0fiE\",\"resolved\":true,\"title\":\"Notion Avatar\",\"body\":\"\u003ch2\u003eOverview\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003e100 Diversity of Notion People. Trendy, clean and minimalist illustrations. Ready to use. Available SVG, EPS, PDF, JPG WEBP, and Figma file. Notion avatar, notion illustrations, notion people, notion. Good for UI design avatar, social media profil, dummy profil, Notion guy/people profil, Notion Template and more what you want.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003eHighlights\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e100 Notion Avatar\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eFull vector and Hi-Resolution assets\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eAvailable vector: SVG, EPS, PDF\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eAvailable ratser : JPG, PNG, Webp\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eDiversity and Unique Illustrations\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eFigma file\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\",\"bodyJson\":{\"type\":\"doc\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"customHeading\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Overview\"}],\"attrs\":{\"level\":1}},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"100 Diversity of Notion People. Trendy, clean and minimalist illustrations. Ready to use. Available SVG, EPS, PDF, JPG WEBP, and Figma file. Notion avatar, notion illustrations, notion people, notion. Good for UI design avatar, social media profil, dummy profil, Notion guy/people profil, Notion Template and more what you want.\"}]},{\"type\":\"customHeading\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Highlights\"}],\"attrs\":{\"level\":2}},{\"type\":\"bulletList\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"100 Notion Avatar\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Full vector and Hi-Resolution assets\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Available vector: SVG, EPS, PDF\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Available ratser : JPG, PNG, Webp\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Diversity and Unique Illustrations\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Figma file\"}]}]}]}]},\"introduction\":\"100 Diversity of Notion People\",\"slug\":\"notion-avatar\",\"author\":{\"framerUserId\":\"0ca56d0e-9094-484e-9ae3-b584d7f93983\",\"name\":\"Vectorly Space\",\"slug\":\"vectorly-space\",\"avatar\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/media/0ca56d0e-9094-484e-9ae3-b584d7f93983/02o4jz3n\",\"followed\":false,\"followsYou\":false},\"media\":[{\"type\":\"image\",\"url\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/media/0ca56d0e-9094-484e-9ae3-b584d7f93983/wfc1e56r\",\"metadata\":{\"tint\":\"hsl(0 0% 57%)\",\"aspectRatio\":1.3235294117647058}},{\"type\":\"image\",\"url\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/media/0ca56d0e-9094-484e-9ae3-b584d7f93983/g0qarzcs\",\"metadata\":{\"tint\":\"hsl(0 0% 57%)\",\"aspectRatio\":1.3235294117647058}},{\"type\":\"image\",\"url\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/media/0ca56d0e-9094-484e-9ae3-b584d7f93983/vc1ewei5\",\"metadata\":{\"tint\":\"hsl(0 0% 57%)\",\"aspectRatio\":1.3235294117647058}},{\"type\":\"image\",\"url\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/media/0ca56d0e-9094-484e-9ae3-b584d7f93983/fzzznf46\",\"metadata\":{\"tint\":\"hsl(0 0% 57%)\",\"aspectRatio\":1.3235294117647058}}],\"post\":{\"id\":\"019ee98e-8109-7697-9cfc-a0453cf3d762\",\"bodyJson\":null,\"likes\":{\"count\":39,\"liked\":false},\"comments\":{\"count\":1},\"reposts\":{\"count\":0,\"reposted\":false,\"repostId\":null}},\"createdAt\":\"2026-06-21T09:41:30.994Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-06-21T09:41:30.994Z\",\"publishedAt\":\"2026-06-21T09:41:30.987Z\",\"featuredAt\":null,\"reported\":false,\"approvedAt\":null,\"type\":\"vector\",\"attributes\":{\"url\":null,\"price\":\"15\",\"paymentUrl\":\"https://vectorly.gumroad.com/l/notion-avatar\",\"vectorCount\":102,\"categories\":[{\"id\":\"78e55a4a-220e-474c-9a7f-690f940cb1de\",\"name\":\"Illustrations\",\"slug\":\"illustrations\"}]}},{\"id\":\"A8vJC4nzUPQBGnk2xnfc\",\"resolved\":true,\"title\":\"Editable Arrows \",\"body\":\"\u003cp\u003eAdd personality and motion to your designs with this \u003cstrong\u003ehand-drawn vector arrow collection, \u003c/strong\u003ecrafted to bring storytelling and flow to your Framer projects.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eEach arrow has its own rhythm: \u003cstrong\u003ecurved, looped, dashed, or playful squiggle\u003c/strong\u003e making it perfect for illustrating direction, highlighting movement, or connecting ideas in a more organic way.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eAll elements are \u003cstrong\u003efully vector-based\u003c/strong\u003e with \u003cstrong\u003eeditable stroke width, color, and scale\u003c/strong\u003e, ensuring seamless customization across Framer or any other design tool.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eWhether you’re building \u003cstrong\u003ecreative presentations, interactive flows, or expressive UI mockups\u003c/strong\u003e, this pack adds a human touch that turns sterile diagrams into engaging narratives.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eQuestions and help : HiHelenSay@gmail.com\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\",\"bodyJson\":null,\"introduction\":\"Playful hand-drawn arrows for Framer projects, perfect for storytelling, flowcharts, and motion cues. Fully vector-based and editable stroke for easy customization.\\n\",\"slug\":\"editable-arrows\",\"author\":{\"framerUserId\":\"5e9178ac-0cf1-46cd-ab75-b55e8e406d28\",\"name\":\"Helen Statsevich\",\"slug\":\"helen-st\",\"avatar\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/media/5e9178ac-0cf1-46cd-ab75-b55e8e406d28/rpwevai5\",\"followed\":false,\"followsYou\":false},\"media\":[{\"type\":\"image\",\"url\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/vector-sets/editable-arrows/nab85ukj-ZBng87uha4mNGKUfZoiV3JYmvxunwj\",\"metadata\":{\"tint\":\"hsl(240 53% 70%)\",\"aspectRatio\":1.3333333333333333}},{\"type\":\"image\",\"url\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/vector-sets/editable-arrows/nq4idsf3-PiRRNCLFCyhgMFQwKfndBU05nkkiqK\",\"metadata\":{\"tint\":\"hsl(240 53% 70%)\",\"aspectRatio\":1.3333333333333333}}],\"post\":{\"id\":\"0199e527-568b-79f1-941f-597df6410179\",\"bodyJson\":null,\"likes\":{\"count\":26,\"liked\":false},\"comments\":{\"count\":1},\"reposts\":{\"count\":0,\"reposted\":false,\"repostId\":null}},\"createdAt\":\"2025-10-09T16:04:21.762Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2025-10-31T16:20:19.806Z\",\"publishedAt\":\"2025-10-14T23: