and rounded corners. Covers the most common UI elements: search, user, heart, star, check, close, arrow, chevron, mail, calendar, clock, lock, cart, trash, and bell. Color, weight, and size stay editable after importing into your project.\u003c/p\u003e\",\"bodyJson\":{\"type\":\"doc\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"A set of 16 minimalist line-style icons, built on a 24x24 grid with a consistent 1.5px stroke and rounded corners. Covers the most common UI elements: search, user, heart, star, check, close, arrow, chevron, mail, calendar, clock, lock, cart, trash, and bell. Color, weight, and size stay editable after importing into your project.\"}]}]},\"introduction\":\"Icon Vector Simple Set\",\"slug\":\"vector-simple-set\",\"author\":{\"framerUserId\":\"a20e5b62-be20-4a48-bf8f-b2fbcd10f71f\",\"name\":\"martechclinica\",\"slug\":\"martech-clinica\",\"avatar\":\"https://framerusercontent.com/avatars/users/a20e5b62-be20-4a48-bf8f-b2fbcd10f71f/mghfOyjkR\",\"followed\":false,\"followsYou\":false},\"media\":[{\"type\":\"image\",\"url\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/media/a20e5b62-be20-4a48-bf8f-b2fbcd10f71f/019faf46-80ff-71bf-9890-6ecf88cf974e.png\",\"metadata\":{\"tint\":\"hsl(240 53% 70%)\",\"aspectRatio\":1.3333333333333333}},{\"type\":\"image\",\"url\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/media/a20e5b62-be20-4a48-bf8f-b2fbcd10f71f/019faf46-8124-772b-afca-79be16d46e7d.png\",\"metadata\":{\"tint\":\"hsl(0 0% 9%)\",\"aspectRatio\":1.3333333333333333}}],\"post\":{\"id\":\"019faf47-ce6d-720d-81c6-683c1f78f1f7\",\"bodyJson\":{\"type\":\"doc\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Conjunto de 16 ícones line minimalistas, grade 24×24, traço consistente de 1.5px. Cobre o essencial de qualquer UI: busca, usuário, coração, estrela, check, fechar, seta, chevron, e-mail, calendário, relógio, cadeado, carrinho, lixeira e sino.\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Cor, espessura e tamanho ficam editáveis direto no seu projeto.\"}]}]},\"likes\":{\"count\":12,\"liked\":false},\"comments\":{\"count\":1},\"reposts\":{\"count\":0,\"reposted\":false,\"repostId\":null}},\"createdAt\":\"2026-07-29T19:09:06.131Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-07-29T19:09:06.131Z\",\"publishedAt\":\"2026-07-29T19:09:06.122Z\",\"featuredAt\":null,\"reported\":false,\"approvedAt\":null,\"type\":\"vector\",\"attributes\":{\"url\":\"https://framer.com/m/Arrow-Right-HmQDgo.js@tfRb8gjUswB4hCvrCHrB\",\"price\":null,\"paymentUrl\":null,\"vectorCount\":16,\"categories\":[{\"id\":\"3535507e-b041-4f48-be7f-a084b14e30b2\",\"name\":\"Icons\",\"slug\":\"icons\"}]}},{\"id\":\"2JccQ9bCqLAsQx3cONh7\",\"resolved\":true,\"title\":\"Navigation Icon Set\",\"body\":\"\u003cp\u003eCreate intuitive and user-friendly digital interfaces with this \u003cstrong\u003eEssential Navigation \u0026amp; Arrow Icon Set\u003c/strong\u003e, a collection of \u003cstrong\u003e25 clean, modern, and minimalist navigation icons\u003c/strong\u003e specifically designed for \u003cstrong\u003emobile applications, websites, SaaS platforms, admin dashboards, web applications, and digital user interfaces\u003c/strong\u003e. Featuring a bold black solid style with pixel-perfect geometry, these icons provide excellent readability and seamless integration into any modern UI/UX design system.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eThis icon pack includes the most frequently used navigation controls and directional symbols, making it an essential resource for designers and developers building responsive and interactive digital products.\u003c/p\u003e\",\"bodyJson\":{\"type\":\"doc\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Create intuitive and user-friendly digital interfaces with this \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Essential Navigation \u0026 Arrow Icon Set\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\", a collection of \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"25 clean, modern, and minimalist navigation icons\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" specifically designed for \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"mobile applications, websites, SaaS platforms, admin dashboards, web applications, and digital user interfaces\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\". Featuring a bold black solid style with pixel-perfect geometry, these icons provide excellent readability and seamless integration into any modern UI/UX design system.\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"This icon pack includes the most frequently used navigation controls and directional symbols, making it an essential resource for designers and developers building responsive and interactive digital products.\"}]}]},\"introduction\":\"Navigation Icon Set\",\"slug\":\"navigation-icon-set\",\"author\":{\"framerUserId\":\"1440e4a2-8652-476d-99d8-ff659c92ba2e\",\"name\":\"Loka Tara\",\"slug\":\"loka-tara\",\"avatar\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/media/1440e4a2-8652-476d-99d8-ff659c92ba2e/q37owu63\",\"followed\":false,\"followsYou\":false},\"media\":[{\"type\":\"image\",\"url\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/media/1440e4a2-8652-476d-99d8-ff659c92ba2e/019f86d5-c342-709a-a7c9-7f46d215068a.jpg\",\"metadata\":{\"tint\":\"hsl(0 0% 57%)\",\"aspectRatio\":1.3245033112582782}},{\"type\":\"image\",\"url\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/media/1440e4a2-8652-476d-99d8-ff659c92ba2e/019f86d5-c86d-70b1-ba97-4ebd81062bd1.png\",\"metadata\":{\"tint\":\"hsl(0 0% 57%)\",\"aspectRatio\":1.5}}],\"post\":{\"id\":\"019f86d7-4aca-702b-99ff-1c31a5fca094\",\"bodyJson\":{\"type\":\"doc\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"NEW UPDATE!! 20 Essential Navigation \u0026 Arrow Icon Set\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"BUY NOW\"}]}]},\"likes\":{\"count\":9,\"liked\":false},\"comments\":{\"count\":0},\"reposts\":{\"count\":0,\"reposted\":false,\"repostId\":null}},\"createdAt\":\"2026-07-21T22:41:23.849Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-07-21T22:41:23.849Z\",\"publishedAt\":\"2026-07-21T22:41:23.844Z\",\"featuredAt\":null,\"reported\":false,\"approvedAt\":null,\"type\":\"vector\",\"attributes\":{\"url\":null,\"price\":\"4\",\"paymentUrl\":\"https://lokatara.lemonsqueezy.com/checkout/buy/7e5af3c5-f26f-4431-8042-5f26e18fc8a1\",\"vectorCount\":25,\"categories\":[{\"id\":\"3535507e-b041-4f48-be7f-a084b14e30b2\",\"name\":\"Icons\",\"slug\":\"icons\"}]}},{\"id\":\"GObVt2XAf1J4bcgLJvHD\",\"resolved\":true,\"title\":\"Art Deco\",\"body\":\"$56\",\"bodyJson\":{\"type\":\"doc\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"A good design isn't always the most sophisticated one; it must also be easy to understand. To enhance clarity, designs are often divided into various sections. However, some sections can appear blurred together for various reasons, which is where a separator or divider becomes essential. While a simple line typically serves this purpose, it's not always suitable, especially when aiming for a classy and professional look.\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"The Golden Brown Art Deco Dividers Elements Set is an excellent alternative for this purpose. It's perfect for invitations, restaurant menus, photo frames, certificates, and more. This divider set features not only straight lines but also combinations of basic geometric shapes, resulting in unique and outstanding dividers. Utilizing these elements will elevate the elegance of your designs.\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"You can easily adjust the golden brown color to suit your needs, allowing you to create a more cohesive design. Use this divider set to achieve a fancy and sophisticated look for both personal and professional projects.\"}]}]},\"introduction\":\"Art Deco Dividers Vector Set\",\"slug\":\"art-deco\",\"author\":{\"framerUserId\":\"088d5fb3-ee76-4827-a5d6-df225d2c1a9c\",\"name\":\"Peterdraw\",\"slug\":\"peterdraw\",\"avatar\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/media/088d5fb3-ee76-4827-a5d6-df225d2c1a9c/b5fscnxj\",\"badges\":[\"pro\"],\"followed\":false,\"followsYou\":false},\"media\":[{\"type\":\"video\",\"url\":\"https://stream.mux.com/01XuNKGj9dkGu02500xKvP00GVNdJ3sz201yBalAksR5vHQA.m3u8\",\"metadata\":{\"posterUrl\":\"https://image.mux.com/01XuNKGj9dkGu02500xKvP00GVNdJ3sz201yBalAksR5vHQA/thumbnail.webp?time=3.633\",\"aspectRatio\":\"4:3\",\"duration\":9.016667}},{\"type\":\"image\",\"url\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/media/088d5fb3-ee76-4827-a5d6-df225d2c1a9c/019fb4d2-d931-76fe-96aa-7ebe4c8f0ae1.png\",\"metadata\":{\"tint\":\"hsl(34 59% 31%)\",\"aspectRatio\":1.3333333333333333}},{\"type\":\"image\",\"url\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/media/088d5fb3-ee76-4827-a5d6-df225d2c1a9c/019fb4d2-e852-70c9-bef7-2ecaa77b1ee6.png\",\"metadata\":{\"tint\":\"hsl(34 59% 31%)\",\"aspectRatio\":1.3333333333333333}},{\"type\":\"image\",\"url\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/media/088d5fb3-ee76-4827-a5d6-df225d2c1a9c/019fb4d2-f2e5-708e-8cf2-287e8b8e772f.png\",\"metadata\":{\"tint\":\"hsl(34 59% 31%)\",\"aspectRatio\":1.3333333333333333}},{\"type\":\"image\",\"url\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/media/088d5fb3-ee76-4827-a5d6-df225d2c1a9c/019fb4d2-ff57-70f6-9d7d-78c0b9d48f64.png\",\"metadata\":{\"tint\":\"hsl(34 59% 31%)\",\"aspectRatio\":1.3333333333333333}}],\"post\":{\"id\":\"019fb4d6-ef61-73c0-ba0c-d3bb879875b7\",\"bodyJson\":{\"type\":\"doc\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Art Deco Dividers vector collection, now on Framer! \"},{\"type\":\"emoji\",\"attrs\":{\"name\":\"partying_face\",\"emoji\":\"🥳\"}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" \"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Straight lines, geometric combinations, adjustable color. Built for certificates, menus, invitations, anything that needs a bit more elegance than a 1px stroke. Enjoy! \"},{\"type\":\"emoji\",\"attrs\":{\"name\":\"raised_hands\",\"emoji\":\"🙌\"}}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\"}]},\"likes\":{\"count\":15,\"liked\":false},\"comments\":{\"count\":0},\"reposts\":{\"count\":0,\"reposted\":false,\"repostId\":null}},\"createdAt\":\"2026-07-30T21:03:32.258Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-07-30T21:03:32.258Z\",\"publishedAt\":\"2026-07-30T21:03:32.235Z\",\"featuredAt\":null,\"reported\":false,\"approvedAt\":null,\"type\":\"vector\",\"attributes\":{\"url\":null,\"price\":\"5\",\"paymentUrl\":\"https://peterdraw.lemonsqueezy.com/checkout/buy/6e1e6c17-bf1f-47b8-9473-3e73a9d8aaba\",\"vectorCount\":15,\"categories\":[{\"id\":\"78e55a4a-220e-474c-9a7f-690f940cb1de\",\"name\":\"Illustrations\",\"slug\":\"illustrations\"}]}},{\"id\":\"R5wwhCvpULn52LrLDcxi\",\"resolved\":true,\"title\":\"Gen-Z Remote Pack\",\"body\":\"\u003cp\u003eElevate your Framer projects with this premium collection of modern, minimalist character vectors. Designed for the 2026 digital landscape, this pack features a relatable Gen-Z/Millennial character engaged in everyday activities—from coding and remote work to yoga and gardening.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePerfect for:\u003c/strong\u003e SaaS landing pages, startup websites, personal portfolios, and tech blogs.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFeatures:\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e10+ versatile poses (Productivity, Lifestyle, Tech)\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eClean, flat-line design that loads lightning fast\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eEasily customizable accent colors to match your brand\u0026#39;s UI\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eFully scalable vector formats built for Framer\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp\u003eHumanize your digital product and engage your users with these trendy, ready-to-use illustrations!\u003c/p\u003e\",\"bodyJson\":{\"type\":\"doc\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Elevate your Framer projects with this premium collection of modern, minimalist character vectors. Designed for the 2026 digital landscape, this pack features a relatable Gen-Z/Millennial character engaged in everyday activities—from coding and remote work to yoga and gardening.\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Perfect for:\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" SaaS landing pages, startup websites, personal portfolios, and tech blogs.\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Features:\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"bulletList\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"10+ versatile poses (Productivity, Lifestyle, Tech)\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Clean, flat-line design that loads lightning fast\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Easily customizable accent colors to match your brand's UI\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Fully scalable vector formats built for Framer\"}]}]}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Humanize your digital product and engage your users with these trendy, ready-to-use illustrations!\"}]}]},\"introduction\":\"Minimalist vectors for modern SaaS\",\"slug\":\"gen-z-remote-pack\",\"author\":{\"framerUserId\":\"265484c2-fd88-4930-9891-2e233c7e9a8f\",\"name\":\"Agie Faishal\",\"slug\":\"agie-faishal\",\"avatar\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/creators/808124/avatar-jerU5H3Jc2sdkJX1bwO5ifp9QeK6Il.jpg\",\"followed\":false,\"followsYou\":false},\"media\":[{\"type\":\"image\",\"url\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/media/265484c2-fd88-4930-9891-2e233c7e9a8f/kq62vg1a\",\"metadata\":{\"tint\":\"hsl(0 0% 57%)\",\"aspectRatio\":1.3333333333333333}},{\"type\":\"image\",\"url\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/media/265484c2-fd88-4930-9891-2e233c7e9a8f/jk1xyn29\",\"metadata\":{\"tint\":\"hsl(0 0% 57%)\",\"aspectRatio\":1.3333333333333333}}],\"post\":{\"id\":\"019f1d3c-99aa-774d-b5a4-771b7d9b3aa9\",\"bodyJson\":{\"type\":\"doc\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"emoji\",\"attrs\":{\"name\":\"rocket\",\"emoji\":\"🚀\"}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Just Dropped! The ultimate vector pack for modern SaaS \u0026 Startups.\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Tired of searching for the perfect landing page illustrations? Meet the \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Gen-Z Remote Pack\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\". 16 minimalist, digital-productivity-themed illustrations designed specifically for the Framer ecosystem.\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"emoji\",\"attrs\":{\"name\":\"sparkles\",\"emoji\":\"✨\"}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Why you'll love it:\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" • Clean-line, modern design tailored for 2026 UI trends. • Natively linked to Framer Color Variables (Change the accent green to your brand's color in just 1 click!) • Lightweight, ready-to-use components.\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Elevate your website's visuals today. Grab it now!\"}]}]},\"likes\":{\"count\":11,\"liked\":false},\"comments\":{\"count\":0},\"reposts\":{\"count\":0,\"reposted\":false,\"repostId\":null}},\"createdAt\":\"2026-07-01T10:32:18.525Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-07-01T10:32:18.525Z\",\"publishedAt\":\"2026-07-01T10:32:18.519Z\",\"featuredAt\":null,\"reported\":false,\"approvedAt\":null,\"type\":\"vector\",\"attributes\":{\"url\":null,\"price\":\"5\",\"paymentUrl\":\"https://agiefaishal.lemonsqueezy.com/checkout/buy/1371f4cc-a956-41d5-a665-b6c7549822b6\",\"vectorCount\":16,\"categories\":[{\"id\":\"78e55a4a-220e-474c-9a7f-690f940cb1de\",\"name\":\"Illustrations\",\"slug\":\"illustrations\"}]}},{\"id\":\"3Pk048HWV29qhehPhmdw\",\"resolved\":true,\"title\":\"Stylokit Icon Free\",\"body\":\"\u003cp\u003eThe Stylokit Icon Free (v1.02) pack features 511 clean stroke icons, crafted with precise geometry and consistent visual rhythm.All icons follow a unified line weight and corner style, making them perfect for modern, minimal, and UI-focused designs.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eThis free collection is a curated preview of the full Stylokit Icon Pro system, giving you access to high-quality, scalable vectors optimized for both Figma and Framer.Ideal for personal use, learning, exploration, and testing the Stylokit quality before upgrading to the full Pro version.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eNow available for React, making it easy to use the icons directly in your projects. The free version is also open source and available on GitHub.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eReact version available on \u003ca href=\\\"https://github.com/dmytri-ivanov-stylokit/stylokit-react-icons\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\"\u003eGitHub\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\",\"bodyJson\":{\"type\":\"doc\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"The Stylokit Icon Free (v1.02) pack features 511 clean stroke icons, crafted with precise geometry and consistent visual rhythm.All icons follow a unified line weight and corner style, making them perfect for modern, minimal, and UI-focused designs.\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"This free collection is a curated preview of the full Stylokit Icon Pro system, giving you access to high-quality, scalable vectors optimized for both Figma and Framer.Ideal for personal use, learning, exploration, and testing the Stylokit quality before upgrading to the full Pro version.\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Now available for React, making it easy to use the icons directly in your projects. The free version is also open source and available on GitHub.\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"React version available on \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"GitHub\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"link\",\"attrs\":{\"rel\":\"noopener noreferrer\",\"href\":\"https://github.com/dmytri-ivanov-stylokit/stylokit-react-icons\",\"target\":\"_blank\"}}]}]}]},\"introduction\":\"Icon Free Pack\",\"slug\":\"stylokit-icon-free\",\"author\":{\"framerUserId\":\"22ccca22-dff6-4bd1-9e17-7ef77ed7e047\",\"name\":\"Dmytri Ivanov\",\"slug\":\"dmytri-ivanov\",\"avatar\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/creators/28916/Avatar%201-gJDXaVPqnUpIfASXYVn23H3Mt6hVc8.jpg\",\"followed\":false,\"followsYou\":false},\"media\":[{\"type\":\"image\",\"url\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/vector-sets/stylokit/y780l3a3-pXIugbBLNx4bFb0o5GFZzDw6vnJP2m\",\"metadata\":{\"tint\":\"hsl(0 0% 9%)\",\"aspectRatio\":1.3333333333333333}},{\"type\":\"image\",\"url\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/vector-sets/stylokit/w5r02k3r-M67jvx7BMtdIqBQVentpUSQOcj15Lr\",\"metadata\":{\"tint\":\"hsl(0 0% 9%)\",\"aspectRatio\":1.3333333333333333}}],\"post\":{\"id\":\"019aaef9-002e-76af-9129-bec64413ee5e\",\"bodyJson\":{\"type\":\"doc\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Now available for React, making it easy to use the icons directly in your projects. The free version is also open source and available on \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"GitHub\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"link\",\"attrs\":{\"rel\":\"noopener noreferrer\",\"href\":\"https://github.com/dmytri-ivanov-stylokit/stylokit-react-icons\",\"target\":\"_blank\"}}]},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\".\"}]}]},\"likes\":{\"count\":38,\"liked\":false},\"comments\":{\"count\":0},\"reposts\":{\"count\":0,\"reposted\":false,\"repostId\":null}},\"createdAt\":\"2025-11-13T12:24:33.437Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-07-31T06:25:39.994Z\",\"publishedAt\":\"2025-11-23T04:29:05.454Z\",\"featuredAt\":null,\"reported\":false,\"approvedAt\":null,\"type\":\"vector\",\"attributes\":{\"url\":\"https://framer.com/m/circle-exclamation-thcY.js@225ikIBWUqUfeB0PSumN\",\"price\":null,\"paymentUrl\":null,\"vectorCount\":509,\"categories\":[{\"id\":\"3535507e-b041-4f48-be7f-a084b14e30b2\",\"name\":\"Icons\",\"slug\":\"icons\"}]}},{\"id\":\"eHUCL2jVzHeB6nWK6RYw\",\"resolved\":true,\"title\":\"Stylokit Icon PRO\",\"body\":\"$57\",\"bodyJson\":{\"type\":\"doc\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Preview: \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"icons.stylokit.com\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"link\",\"attrs\":{\"rel\":\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\",\"href\":\"https://icons.stylokit.com/\",\"target\":\"_blank\"}}]}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"All three styles share identical geometry, proportions, and visual logic, ensuring full interchangeability across any interface. Every icon uses a smooth-corner design by default, providing a clean, modern look that fits perfectly with contemporary UI design.\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"The system spans \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"46 categories\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\", covering everything from essential UI elements to extended themes such as Science, Travel, Nature, Business, and more.Each icon is fully optimized for Framer, offering perfect scaling, clean alignment, and seamless performance inside components and variants.\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Crafted with years of design experience, this icon system represents a refined, professional, and highly practical UI library — built specifically for Framer by Stylokit.\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\"},{\"type\":\"bulletList\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Version 1.06 is now available with new icons and improvements.\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Version 1.07 is now available with new icons and improvements.\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Now available as a React icon package, so you can easily import and use icons directly in your projects.\"}]}]}]}]},\"introduction\":\"One icon system\",\"slug\":\"stylokit-stroke-pro\",\"author\":{\"framerUserId\":\"22ccca22-dff6-4bd1-9e17-7ef77ed7e047\",\"name\":\"Dmytri Ivanov\",\"slug\":\"dmytri-ivanov\",\"avatar\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/creators/28916/Avatar%201-gJDXaVPqnUpIfASXYVn23H3Mt6hVc8.jpg\",\"followed\":false,\"followsYou\":false},\"media\":[{\"type\":\"image\",\"url\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/vector-sets/stylokit-stroke-pro/y7pktf4e-a6Zj0LAETDkeNyyt4YgzPSlo3ucpfw\",\"metadata\":{\"tint\":\"hsl(0 0% 9%)\",\"aspectRatio\":1.3333333333333333}},{\"type\":\"image\",\"url\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/vector-sets/stylokit-stroke-pro/wu49xb5r-vBtkreS7aiMAo7Z4XqKirAx5vY5EfV\",\"metadata\":{\"tint\":\"hsl(0 0% 9%)\",\"aspectRatio\":1.3333333333333333}},{\"type\":\"image\",\