k\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" to highlight key visual content.\"}]}]},\"likes\":{\"count\":11,\"liked\":false},\"comments\":{\"count\":4},\"reposts\":{\"count\":0,\"reposted\":false,\"repostId\":null}},\"createdAt\":\"2026-07-29T15:55:47.257Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-07-29T15:55:47.257Z\",\"publishedAt\":\"2026-07-29T15:55:47.252Z\",\"featuredAt\":null,\"reported\":false,\"approvedAt\":null,\"type\":\"vector\",\"attributes\":{\"url\":\"https://framer.com/m/Yes-02e5n8.js@PTWOrnytLBvyIUitJnF6\",\"price\":null,\"paymentUrl\":null,\"vectorCount\":11,\"categories\":[{\"id\":\"78e55a4a-220e-474c-9a7f-690f940cb1de\",\"name\":\"Illustrations\",\"slug\":\"illustrations\"}]}},{\"id\":\"3d488sztqri0U3KX672z\",\"resolved\":true,\"title\":\"Notion-style Icons\",\"body\":\"\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eYou will get access to:\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e250 high-resolution SVG and PNG icons\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eNew upcoming icons\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eWhere can you use the icons?\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eLanding pages, websites, and apps\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eNotion templates\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003ePrinting material (flyers, posters, t-shirts, gadgets, books, etc.)\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFeatures\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eFully scalable vector files\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eEasily change colours to match your brand\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eCompletely customisable in your favourite tools (Framer, Figma, Illustrator, etc.)\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eHow can I get in touch with you?\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eYou can contact me directly at \u003ca target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\\\" href=\\\"mailto:mariannaamato88@gmail.com\\\"\u003emariannaamato88@gmail.com.\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\",\"bodyJson\":null,\"introduction\":\"250 SVG and PNG Notion-style icons.\",\"slug\":\"notion-style-icons\",\"author\":{\"framerUserId\":\"5e58559d-eb06-4d96-9f90-9108dc0d1be4\",\"name\":\"Marianna Amato\",\"slug\":\"marianna-amato\",\"avatar\":null,\"followed\":false,\"followsYou\":false},\"media\":[{\"type\":\"image\",\"url\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/vector-sets/notion-style-icons/v9dsz8eq-REFVxerGJrLEqgr9KcJI2HmCV79tlG\",\"metadata\":{\"tint\":\"hsl(0 0% 57%)\",\"aspectRatio\":1.3333333333333333}},{\"type\":\"image\",\"url\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/vector-sets/notion-style-icons/g20s6yz6-gffW17RwKNBHA6v6xDhqwyK5MoIS9x\",\"metadata\":{\"tint\":\"hsl(0 0% 57%)\",\"aspectRatio\":1.3333333333333333}}],\"post\":{\"id\":\"0199c9cb-3e31-771d-8f01-fb3ca106532d\",\"bodyJson\":null,\"likes\":{\"count\":6,\"liked\":false},\"comments\":{\"count\":0},\"reposts\":{\"count\":0,\"reposted\":false,\"repostId\":null}},\"createdAt\":\"2025-09-29T17:44:53.742Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2025-10-09T16:26:04.209Z\",\"publishedAt\":\"2025-10-09T16:26:04.209Z\",\"featuredAt\":null,\"reported\":false,\"approvedAt\":null,\"type\":\"vector\",\"attributes\":{\"url\":null,\"price\":\"19\",\"paymentUrl\":\"https://maryamato88.gumroad.com/l/prhsz\",\"vectorCount\":250,\"categories\":[{\"id\":\"3535507e-b041-4f48-be7f-a084b14e30b2\",\"name\":\"Icons\",\"slug\":\"icons\"}]}},{\"id\":\"sM3MecQKjuQata0EzaMk\",\"resolved\":true,\"title\":\"Vector Icons\",\"body\":\"\u003cp\u003eA versatile vectors set of 16 essential icons, hand-drawn one by one\u003cem\u003e (no AI, no auto-generated templates)\u003c/em\u003e. Every icon is editable, so you can change the color and size to fit your own brand or project. Built to cover the core actions and UI elements every project needs, from e-commerce to social platforms to everyday dashboards.  \u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eIcons included:\u003c/strong\u003e\u2028 User, cart, heart-outline, heart-filled, sound-on, sound-off, home, pin, search, language, menu, chat, mail, share, settings, info.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eIcons in\u003cstrong\u003e SVG\u003c/strong\u003e + \u003cstrong\u003ePNG\u003c/strong\u003e zip folder and Framer link.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003e→ This is a digital product, so I\u0026#39;m not able to offer refunds. For questions or support, feel free to reach out: \u003c/em\u003e\u003ca href=\\\"mailto:babiweb@proton.me\\\"\u003e\u003cem\u003ebabiweb@proton.me\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\",\"bodyJson\":{\"type\":\"doc\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"A versatile vectors set of 16 essential icons, hand-drawn one by one\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" (no AI, no auto-generated templates)\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"italic\"}]},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\". Every icon is editable, so you can change the color and size to fit your own brand or project. Built to cover the core actions and UI elements every project needs, from e-commerce to social platforms to everyday dashboards.  \"}]},{\"type\":\"bulletList\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Icons included:\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"\u2028 User, cart, heart-outline, heart-filled, sound-on, sound-off, home, pin, search, language, menu, chat, mail, share, settings, info.\"}]}]}]},{\"type\":\"bulletList\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Icons in\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" SVG\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" + \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"PNG\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" zip folder and Framer link.\"}]}]}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"→ This is a digital product, so I'm not able to offer refunds. For questions or support, feel free to reach out: \",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"italic\"}]},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"babiweb@proton.me\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"link\",\"attrs\":{\"rel\":\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\",\"href\":\"mailto:babiweb@proton.me\",\"target\":\"_blank\"}},{\"type\":\"italic\"}]}]}]},\"introduction\":\"e-commerce / social platforms\",\"slug\":\"vector-icons\",\"author\":{\"framerUserId\":\"aef8ff5e-a513-4386-8f83-1d1b795601df\",\"name\":\"BabiWeb\",\"slug\":\"babiweb\",\"avatar\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/media/aef8ff5e-a513-4386-8f83-1d1b795601df/drzkih0b\",\"followed\":false,\"followsYou\":false},\"media\":[{\"type\":\"image\",\"url\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/media/aef8ff5e-a513-4386-8f83-1d1b795601df/019f6b53-e1de-733b-a98a-7a8172c88aca.png\",\"metadata\":{\"tint\":\"hsl(0 0% 3%)\",\"aspectRatio\":1.3333333333333333}},{\"type\":\"image\",\"url\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/media/aef8ff5e-a513-4386-8f83-1d1b795601df/019f6b53-f6e8-70ed-8c3a-280893764be9.png\",\"metadata\":{\"tint\":\"hsl(0 0% 57%)\",\"aspectRatio\":1.3333333333333333}}],\"post\":{\"id\":\"019f6ae9-1e99-70d6-a96d-c48ccd2580cc\",\"bodyJson\":{\"type\":\"doc\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"emoji\",\"attrs\":{\"name\":\"sparkles\",\"emoji\":\"✨\"}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" my icons are ready! \"},{\"type\":\"emoji\",\"attrs\":{\"name\":\"heavy_check_mark\",\"emoji\":\"✔\"}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" \"},{\"type\":\"emoji\",\"attrs\":{\"name\":\"sparkles\",\"emoji\":\"✨\"}}]}]},\"likes\":{\"count\":5,\"liked\":false},\"comments\":{\"count\":0},\"reposts\":{\"count\":0,\"reposted\":false,\"repostId\":null}},\"createdAt\":\"2026-07-16T12:31:30.122Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-08-05T11:56:33.825Z\",\"publishedAt\":\"2026-07-16T12:31:30.117Z\",\"featuredAt\":null,\"reported\":false,\"approvedAt\":null,\"type\":\"vector\",\"attributes\":{\"url\":null,\"price\":\"2\",\"paymentUrl\":\"https://babiweb.gumroad.com/l/hogxjn?wanted=true\",\"vectorCount\":16,\"categories\":[{\"id\":\"3535507e-b041-4f48-be7f-a084b14e30b2\",\"name\":\"Icons\",\"slug\":\"icons\"}]}},{\"id\":\"wFNwpulgLau2QyxHabT0\",\"resolved\":true,\"title\":\"Payment Card Logos\",\"body\":\"\u003cp\u003eThis free vector set contains logos of the most popular credit cards and payment methods for ecommerce and product websites. By displaying payment method logos on your site, you can increase conversion rates and build trust with customers before they pay.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe full set of logos included is:\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eAlipay\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eAmerican Express\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eApple Pay\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eCartes Bancaires\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eCashApp\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eDiners\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eDiscover\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eGoogle Pay\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eInterac\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eJCB\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eKlarna\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eLink\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eMastercard\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003ePayPal\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eShop Pay\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eUnionPay\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eVenmo\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eVisa\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\",\"bodyJson\":null,\"introduction\":\"Build trust with customers and increase conversion rates with this collection of credit card and payment method logos.\",\"slug\":\"payment-card-logos\",\"author\":{\"framerUserId\":\"af6b5c1e-9f7f-41b0-983d-7f97f99d7c72\",\"name\":\"Isaac Roberts\",\"slug\":\"framestack\",\"avatar\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/creators/35028/kSFjV8bIu-AKT3u2pg7PrZL7rowyGEY3MFSLial5\",\"followed\":false,\"followsYou\":false},\"media\":[{\"type\":\"image\",\"url\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/vector-sets/payment-card-logos/mf83e8yz-uO6ImilWBD2LzGWM3cvqxAmz90Qec5\",\"metadata\":{\"tint\":\"hsl(0 0% 3%)\",\"aspectRatio\":1.3333333333333333}},{\"type\":\"image\",\"url\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/vector-sets/payment-card-logos/q8m56jus-z9JgytxJgVwvpcRuf9HGRilFkVGyfU\",\"metadata\":{\"tint\":\"hsl(240 53% 70%)\",\"aspectRatio\":1.3333333333333333}}],\"post\":{\"id\":\"0199bdd5-173a-7ae8-a270-c2e10e39c25a\",\"bodyJson\":null,\"likes\":{\"count\":35,\"liked\":false},\"comments\":{\"count\":0},\"reposts\":{\"count\":0,\"reposted\":false,\"repostId\":null}},\"createdAt\":\"2025-10-06T17:23:22.716Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2025-10-08T14:15:16.930Z\",\"publishedAt\":\"2025-10-07T08:41:23.002Z\",\"featuredAt\":\"2026-07-13T18:48:24.948Z\",\"reported\":false,\"approvedAt\":null,\"type\":\"vector\",\"attributes\":{\"url\":\"https://framer.com/m/American-Express-Asbw.js@W8mPtkh5tPAplotTR9mq\",\"price\":null,\"paymentUrl\":null,\"vectorCount\":19,\"categories\":[{\"id\":\"fa19b5a7-a3be-4f68-9ba4-25800d07d1a3\",\"name\":\"Logos\",\"slug\":\"logos\"}]}},{\"id\":\"VUA74An8FxuALd5loBY3\",\"resolved\":true,\"title\":\"Stars Shapes Vactor\",\"body\":\"$59\",\"bodyJson\":{\"type\":\"doc\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Y2K Starburst \u0026 Sparkle Vector Pack\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Elevate your digital designs with a versatile collection of \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"vector starbursts, sparkles, and geometric Y2K symbols\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\". Designed with a modern retro-futuristic aesthetic, this asset pack blends classic 4-point sparkles, wireframe geometric orbits, chrome-inspired flares, and abstract celestial glyphs—perfect for visual assets, graphic layouts, and UI decor.\"}]},{\"type\":\"customHeading\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"emoji\",\"attrs\":{\"name\":\"milky_way\",\"emoji\":\"🌌\"}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" What It Includes\"}],\"attrs\":{\"level\":1}},{\"type\":\"customHeading\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"emoji\",\"attrs\":{\"name\":\"sparkles\",\"emoji\":\"✨\"}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" Classic \u0026 Minimal Sparkles\"}],\"attrs\":{\"level\":2}},{\"type\":\"bulletList\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Solid \u0026 Outlined Stars:\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" A comprehensive range of 4-point starbursts, cross flares, and subtle glints in both filled solid silhouettes and clean line-art outlines.\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Elongated Cross Flares:\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" Lens flare shapes with extended vertical and horizontal beams for dramatic lighting accents.\"}]}]}]},{\"type\":\"customHeading\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"emoji\",\"attrs\":{\"name\":\"art\",\"emoji\":\"🎨\"}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" Key Features\"}],\"attrs\":{\"level\":1}},{\"type\":\"bulletList\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Fully Scalable Vector Format:\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" Infinite resolution scalability without loss of detail, ideal for print and high-res screen displays.\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Dual-Style Versatility:\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" Features both \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Solid Fill\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" and \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Precision Line Art (Stroke)\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" variations to match any design weight.\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Y2K \u0026 Cyberpunk Aesthetic:\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" Designed specifically to fit aesthetic trends like Cyberpunk, Acid Graphic, Vaporwave, Modern Minimalist, and Retro-Futurism.\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Customizable:\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" Easily change colors, stroke weights, fills, or scale individual elements in software like Adobe Illustrator, Figma, Photoshop, or Canva.\"}]}]}]},{\"type\":\"customHeading\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"emoji\",\"attrs\":{\"name\":\"rocket\",\"emoji\":\"🚀\"}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" Best Used For\"}],\"attrs\":{\"level\":1}},{\"type\":\"bulletList\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"emoji\",\"attrs\":{\"name\":\"art\",\"emoji\":\"🎨\"}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" Poster design, album art covers \u0026 branding assets\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"emoji\",\"attrs\":{\"name\":\"shirt\",\"emoji\":\"👕\"}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" Apparel graphics, streetwear prints \u0026 merchandise design\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"emoji\",\"attrs\":{\"name\":\"iphone\",\"emoji\":\"📱\"}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" Social media graphics, banner visual anchors \u0026 promo flyers\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"emoji\",\"attrs\":{\"name\":\"computer\",\"emoji\":\"💻\"}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" UI/UX decorative accents, web icons \u0026 Framer canvas overlays\"}]}]}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Made with \"},{\"type\":\"emoji\",\"attrs\":{\"name\":\"yellow_heart\",\"emoji\":\"💛\"}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" by \"},{\"type\":\"mention\",\"attrs\":{\"id\":\"cdbd7ebc-86d4-4b64-baea-421f236c7c35\",\"slug\":\"karim-saif\",\"label\":\"Karim Saif\",\"mentionSuggestionChar\":\"@\"}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" \"}]}]},\"introduction\":\"Sparkle Vector Pack\",\"slug\":\"stars-shapes-vactor\",\"author\":{\"framerUserId\":\"cdbd7ebc-86d4-4b64-baea-421f236c7c35\",\"name\":\"Karim Saif\",\"slug\":\"karim-saif\",\"avatar\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/creators/38316/JKMR4LgEt-1ogBJEJjcXu0BLVSwyn9DCkQ64JbBx\",\"followed\":false,\"followsYou\":false},\"media\":[{\"type\":\"image\",\"url\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/media/cdbd7ebc-86d4-4b64-baea-421f236c7c35/019fae12-7460-707e-a559-8b7075898518.png\",\"metadata\":{\"tint\":\"hsl(120 67% 14%)\",\"aspectRatio\":1.3333333333333333}},{\"type\":\"image\",\"url\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/media/cdbd7ebc-86d4-4b64-baea-421f236c7c35/019fae0f-8bc4-71f6-bc43-7d5cc01e64dd.png\",\"metadata\":{\"tint\":\"hsl(210 67% 9%)\",\"aspectRatio\":1.5073431241655542}}],\"post\":{\"id\":\"019fae13-fb9a-74ef-81dd-05d216b83b30\",\"bodyJson\":{\"type\":\"doc\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Y2K \u0026 Cyberpunk Aesthetic:\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" Designed specifically to fit aesthetic trends like Cyberpunk, Acid Graphic, Vaporwave, Modern Minimalist, and Retro-Futurism.\"}]}]},\"likes\":{\"count\":23,\"liked\":false},\"comments\":{\"count\":0},\"reposts\":{\"count\":0,\"reposted\":false,\"repostId\":null}},\"createdAt\":\"2026-07-29T13:32:52.595Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-07-29T13:32:52.595Z\",\"publishedAt\":\"2026-07-29T13:32:52.578Z\",\"featuredAt\":null,\"reported\":false,\"approvedAt\":null,\"type\":\"vector\",\"attributes\":{\"url\":\"https://framer.com/m/star-filled-plain-Ogb8cQ.js@odHfpAf4otCwm3f1GIn8\",\"price\":null,\"paymentUrl\":null,\"vectorCount\":48,\"categories\":[{\"id\":\"89c679b1-87fd-4d3a-830c-c029d9c86011\",\"name\":\"Shapes\",\"slug\":\"shapes\"}]}},{\"id\":\"UQWnt4qQeqesSwWwbFaG\",\"resolved\":true,\"title\":\"Business Strategy\",\"body\":\"$5a\",\"bodyJson\":{\"type\":\"doc\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Bring strategy, innovation, and business growth to your digital projects with the \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Business Strategy Essentials Illustration Set\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\". This collection features beautifully crafted vector illustrations designed to showcase strategic planning, market analysis, goal setting, leadership, decision-making, and business development through clean and modern visuals.\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Perfect for Framer websites, startup platforms, SaaS products, corporate websites, consulting services, business dashboards, marketing platforms, and company landing pages, these illustrations are fully scalable, lightweight, and easy to customize. Each illustration is designed with a modern, professional style that seamlessly fits contemporary websites and digital products.\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Features:\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"bulletList\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"High-quality editable vector illustrations\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Modern, clean, and professional designs\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Perfect for business strategy, planning, consulting, and growth projects\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Easy to customize colors and design elements\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Optimized for Framer projects and components\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Fully scalable without losing quality\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Suitable for websites, mobile apps, presentations, dashboards, and marketing materials\"}]}]}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Whether you're showcasing business planning, market research, strategic meetings, performance analysis, leadership, financial growth, project management, or long-term business goals, the \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Business Strategy Essentials Illustration Set\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" helps create engaging visual experiences that communicate confidence, innovation, and sustainable growth.\"}]}]},\"introduction\":\"Business Strategy Pack\",\"slug\":\"business-strategy\",\"author\":{\"framerUserId\":\"154d0636-e767-4df5-9f36-6ac0c379b611\",\"name\":\"Cursoria Studio\",\"slug\":\"cursoria-studio\",\"avatar\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/creators/2581207/4DdSlH6iy-R0vaAObimz4xJKd8uMqz7kychAYLv4\",\"followed\":false,\"followsYou\":false},\"media\":[{\"type\":\"image\",\"url\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/media/154d0636-e767-4df5-9f36-6ac0c379b611/019f6e44-5fe4-7391-ad40-fd91a08d5255.jpg\",\"metadata\":{\"tint\":\"hsl(0 0% 58%)\",\"aspectRatio\":1.3333333333333333}},{\"type\":\"image\",\"url\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/media/154d0636-e767-4df5-9f36-6ac0c379b611/019f6e44-5ff5-774a-933e-7a272cbdd01f.jpg\",\"metadata\":{\"tint\":\"hsl(0 0% 58%)\",\"aspectRatio\":1.3333333333333333}}],\"post\":{\"id\":\"019f6e44-ed1b-75f3-9689-fb85cd579f57\",\"bodyJson\":{\"type\":\"doc\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"FREE Business Strategy Essentials Illustration Set!\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" Build modern startup websites, business platforms, and consulting projects with this clean illustration pack. Fully editable, scalable, Framer-ready, and free to download.\"}]}]},\"likes\":{\"count\":20,\"liked\":false},\"comments\":{\"count\":0},\"reposts\":{\"count\":0,\"reposted\":false,\"repostId\":null}},\"createdAt\":\"2026-07-17T04:10:38.440Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-07-17T04:10:38.440Z\",\"publishedAt\":\"2026-07-17T04:10:38.431Z\",\"featuredAt\":null,\"reported\":false,\"approvedAt\":null,\"type\":\"vector\",\"attributes\":{\"url\":\"https://framer.com/m/Business-Strategy-Essentials-1-wrfjEd.js@xVUTCsR14XswkQL2PmUU\",\"price\":null,\"paymentUrl\":null,\"vectorCount\":15,\"categories\":[{\"id\":\"78e55a4a-220e-474c-9a7f-690f940cb1de\",\"name\":\"Illustrations\",\"slug\":\"illustrations\"}]}},{\"id\":\"8l3b6oQ3DDzTLtGYL32K\",\"resolved\":true,\"title\":\"Logometry\",\"body\":\"\u003cp\u003eCreate polished and realistic mockups with \u003cstrong\u003e40 modern geometric placeholder logos\u003c/strong\u003e. Designed for UI/UX, websites, presentations, portfolios, and branding concepts, Logometry helps simulate fictional brands while keeping the focus on your design.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eIncludes\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e40 Unique Geometric Logos\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eFully Vector \u0026amp; Scalable\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eConsistent Modern Style\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003ePerfect for Mockups \u0026amp; Presentations\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eNote:\u003c/strong\u003e These logos are fictional placeholders intended for previews and demonstrations, not for use as official trademarks or commercial brand identities.\u003c/p\u003e\",\"bodyJson\":{\"type\":\"doc\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Create polished and realistic mockups with \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"40 modern geometric placeholder logos\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\". Designed for UI/UX, websites, presentations, portfolios, and branding concepts, Logometry helps simulate fictional brands while keeping the focus on your design.\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Includes\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"bulletList\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"40 Unique Geometric Logos\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Fully Vector \u0026 Scalable\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Consistent Modern Style\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Perfect for Mockups \u0026 Presentations\"}]}]}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Note:\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" These logos are fictional placeholders intended for previews and demonstrations, not for use as official trademarks or commercial brand identities.\"}]}]},\"introduction\":\"Geometric Brand Placeholder Logos\",\"slug\":\"logometry\",\"author\":{\"framerUserId\":\"ad51ac17-dde0-437c-86d9-e5bdc209191c\",\"name\":\"Punloka\",\"slug\":\"punloka\",\"avatar\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/creators/504655/avatar-bptS8eULX4wdaiellNt7JHhPcQXSvh.jpg\",\"followed\":false,\"followsYou\":false},\"media\":[{\"type\":\"image\",\"url\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/media/ad51ac17-dde0-437c-86d9-e5bdc209191c/019fc9f7-6b6a-72ef-9f6a-cf6cad2e43c0.png\",\"metadata\":{\"tint\":\"hsl(0 0% 58%)\",\"aspectRatio\":1.3333333333333333}},{\"type\":\"image\",\"url\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/media/ad51ac17-dde0-437c-86d9-e5bdc209191c/019fc9f7-8273-75e4-9ce5-bbd74ca86c70.png\",\"metadata\":{\"tint\":\"hsl(0 0% 58%)\",\"aspectRatio\":1.3333333333333333}}],\"post\":{\"id\":\"019fc9f7-bd38-744d-9797-a8e7e088b901\",\"bodyJson\":null,\"likes\":{\"count\":5,\"liked\":false},\"comments\":{\"count\":1},\"reposts\":{\"count\":0,\"reposted\":false,\"repostId\":null}},\"createdAt\":\"2026-08-03T23:31:23.623Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-08-03T23:31:23.623Z\",\"publishedAt\":\"2026-08-03T23:31:23.617Z\",\"featuredAt\":null,\"reported\":false,\"approvedAt\":null,\"type\":\"vector\",\"attributes\":{\"url\":\"https://framer.com/m/Angle-Stack-YO0IXe.js@CYPCt5UrGZ3C3EWNgsRw\",\"price\":null,\"paymentUrl\":null,\"vectorCount\":40,\"categories\":[{\"id\":\"fa19b5a7-a3be-4f68-9ba4-25800d07d1a3\",\"name\":\"Logos\",\"slug\":\"logos\"}]}},{\"id\":\"bbhyw2kiGvxwyrX8ye8n\",\"resolved\":true,\"title\":\"Professional Employe\",\"body\":\"$5b\",\"bodyJson\":{\"type\":\"doc\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Bring professionalism, teamwork, and workplace excellence to your business projects with the \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Professional Employee Essentials Illustration Set\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\". This collection features beautifully crafted vector illustrations designed to showcase office life, employee collaboration, productivity, leadership, and professional development through clean and modern visuals.\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Perfect for Framer websites, corporate platforms, HR solutions, recruitment agencies, business dashboards, startup websites, internal portals, and workplace management systems, these illustrations are fully scalable, lightweight, and easy to customize. Each illustration is designed with a modern, approachable style that fits seamlessly into contemporary websites and digital products.\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Features:\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"bulletList\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"High-quality editable vector illustrations\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Modern, clean, and professional designs\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Perfect for employees, workplaces, HR, and business projects\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Easy to customize colors and design elements\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Optimized for Framer projects and components\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Fully scalable without losing quality\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Suitable for websites, mobile apps, presentations, dashboards, and marketing materials\"}]}]}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Whether you're showcasing office teams, employee onboarding, workplace collaboration, professional skills, leadership, business meetings, company culture, or career development, the \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Professional Employee Essentials Illustration Set\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" helps create engaging visual experiences that communicate productivity, trust, and professional success.\"}]}]},\"introduction\":\"Professional Employee Pack\",\"slug\":\"professional-employe\",\"author\":{\"framerUserId\":\"154d0636-e767-4df5-9f36-6ac0c379b611\",\"name\":\"Cursoria Studio\",\"slug\":\"cursoria-studio\",\"avatar\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/creators/2581207/4DdSlH6iy-R0vaAObimz4xJKd8uMqz7kychAYLv4\",\"followed\":false,\"followsYou\":false},\"media\":[{\"type\":\"image\",\"url\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/media/154d0636-e767-4df5-9f36-6ac0c379b611/019f6e07-7939-711d-972b-d7370e78cc11.jpg\",\"metadata\":{\"tint\":\"hsl(0 0% 58%)\",\"aspectRatio\":1.3333333333333333}},{\"type\":\"image\",\"url\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/media/154d0636-e767-4df5-9f36-6ac0c379b611/019f6e07-7947-70bf-aad8-7cc9f0475fa0.jpg\",\"metadata\":{\"tint\":\"hsl(0 0% 58%)\",\"aspectRatio\":1.3333333333333333}}],\"post\":{\"id\":\"019f6e07-db68-776a-a39d-b64ba23c1a5d\",\"bodyJson\":{\"type\":\"doc\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"ty