,\"publishedAt\":\"2026-07-05T09:23:14.542Z\",\"featuredAt\":null,\"reported\":false,\"approvedAt\":null,\"type\":\"vector\",\"attributes\":{\"url\":null,\"price\":\"4\",\"paymentUrl\":\"https://buy.polar.sh/polar_cl_FVU5F7XDt5D3xlaXSAEfW5XmVIGxsg2OveS8i0IJHTZ\",\"vectorCount\":4,\"categories\":[{\"id\":\"78e55a4a-220e-474c-9a7f-690f940cb1de\",\"name\":\"Illustrations\",\"slug\":\"illustrations\"}]}},{\"id\":\"fsMSgNu8yN7dWTqv7LFT\",\"resolved\":true,\"title\":\"Iconsa Soft Icons\",\"body\":\"\u003cp\u003eIconsa Soft Icons is a collection of 21 beautifully crafted, minimal icons with a soft and modern look. Each icon features smooth gradients, rounded shapes, and balanced simplicity — perfect for adding a friendly yet professional feel to your designs.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eTailored for Framer, these icons are ideal for dashboards, portfolios, landing pages, and mobile layouts. Their subtle depth and clean form make them blend seamlessly into any interface, while maintaining focus on clarity and aesthetics.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e21 handcrafted soft-style icons\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eVector-based and fully scalable\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eConsistent, minimal, and modern design\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eGreat for web apps, portfolios, and creative websites\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp\u003eBring a touch of softness and harmony to your next project with Iconsa.\u003c/p\u003e\",\"bodyJson\":null,\"introduction\":\"A clean and elegant set of soft, minimal icons crafted to bring a modern and friendly look to your Framer projects.\",\"slug\":\"iconsa\",\"author\":{\"framerUserId\":\"47745ef1-855e-412c-a101-305ac078cd49\",\"name\":\"FrameSpace\",\"slug\":\"framespace\",\"avatar\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/creators/129533/avatar-CUOFZiJvUMrfCqPnaTe2BesapDWMrY.jpg\",\"followed\":false,\"followsYou