e\",\"url\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/vector-sets/fintech-ops/ne3jmny1-8AYK1T7vSrLlBd7EzJtrZyDaeDp87q\",\"metadata\":{\"tint\":\"hsl(240 75% 13%)\",\"aspectRatio\":1.3333333333333333}},{\"type\":\"image\",\"url\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/vector-sets/fintech-ops/8ujgbmcm-tqkFGgGshj2JY3HRzS7WU58FNfgLWa\",\"metadata\":{\"tint\":\"hsl(240 75% 13%)\",\"aspectRatio\":1.3333333333333333}},{\"type\":\"image\",\"url\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/vector-sets/fintech-ops/g2cbv41b-CtreUHZjm8NA9y6Ux20nKX37XoWSuU\",\"metadata\":{\"tint\":\"hsl(240 77% 74%)\",\"aspectRatio\":1.3333333333333333}}],\"post\":{\"id\":\"019d483c-e224-7259-9f27-5486c87401a2\",\"bodyJson\":null,\"likes\":{\"count\":4,\"liked\":false},\"comments\":{\"count\":0},\"reposts\":{\"count\":0,\"reposted\":false,\"repostId\":null}},\"createdAt\":\"2026-04-01T07:01:52.233Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-04-01T08:50:42.852Z\",\"publishedAt\":\"2026-04-01T08:50:42.852Z\",\"featuredAt\":null,\"reported\":false,\"approvedAt\":null,\"type\":\"vector\",\"attributes\":{\"url\":null,\"price\":\"7\",\"paymentUrl\":\"https://punloka.lemonsqueezy.com/checkout/buy/126f5e3b-4a21-47b5-ac92-f72921870f49\",\"vectorCount\":60,\"categories\":[{\"id\":\"65fa91ad-4375-40c0-8b72-1cc71f2f4000\",\"name\":\"Business\",\"slug\":\"business\"}]}},{\"id\":\"7Max2u9SHakMipNc8NWF\",\"resolved\":true,\"title\":\"Essential Arrows\",\"body\":\"\u003cp\u003eA clean and flexible SVG arrow icon pack designed for modern interfaces and design systems. The pack includes \u003cstrong\u003edirectional arrows, chevrons, circled and squared arrows, navigation controls, transfer arrows, upload and download icons, expand and collapse controls, refresh, shuffle, and more.\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eBuilt with consistency in mind and fully customizable — easily adjust size, color, and stroke width to fit your brand or project. Perfect for \u003cstrong\u003ewebsites, apps, dashboards, navigation, buttons, and UI components.\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eCompatible with \u003cstrong\u003eFigma, Framer, Webflow\u003c/strong\u003e, and other modern design tools.\u003c/p\u003e\",\"bodyJson\":{\"type\":\"doc\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"A clean and flexible SVG arrow icon pack designed for modern interfaces and design systems. The pack includes \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"directional arrows, chevrons, circled and squared arrows, navigation controls, transfer arrows, upload and download icons, expand and collapse controls, refresh, shuffle, and more.\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Built with consistency in mind and fully customizable — easily adjust size, color, and stroke width to fit your brand or project. Perfect for \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"websites, apps, dashboards, navigation, buttons, and UI components.\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Compatible with \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Figma, Framer, Webflow\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\", and other modern design tools.\"}]}]},\"introduction\":\"Arrow Icons for Modern UI systems\",\"slug\":\"essential-arrows\",\"author\":{\"framerUserId\":\"427d27c5-4225-4abf-b4af-887d568a3b5b\",\"name\":\"Mathilda Ingvaldsen\",\"slug\":\"mathilda-ingvaldsen\",\"avatar\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/creators/1884298/avatar-6aPXWEmDRkjtzgy3MBc7y0XwCkWmMz.jpg\",\"followed\":false,\"followsYou\":false},\"media\":[{\"type\":\"image\",\"url\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/media/427d27c5-4225-4abf-b4af-887d568a3b5b/01a03fbd-ded1-73c4-a063-434749e636e6.png\",\"metadata\":{\"tint\":\"hsl(0 0% 57%)\",\"aspectRatio\":1.3333333333333333}},{\"type\":\"image\",\"url\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/media/427d27c5-4225-4abf-b4af-887d568a3b5b/01a03597-31c6-7224-9cfc-d0dd8ff93e33.png\",\"metadata\":{\"tint\":\"hsl(0 0% 57%)\",\"aspectRatio\":1.3333333333333333}},{\"type\":\"image\",\"url\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/media/427d27c5-4225-4abf-b4af-887d568a3b5b/01a03597-31a9-708a-8a86-52dd7434ff68.png\",\"metadata\":{\"tint\":\"hsl(0 0% 57%)\",\"aspectRatio\":1.3333333333333333}}],\"post\":{\"id\":\"019e3f91-c9e7-76da-a592-4510e090f649\",\"bodyJson\":null,\"likes\":{\"count\":13,\"liked\":false},\"comments\":{\"count\":0},\"reposts\":{\"count\":0,\"reposted\":false,\"repostId\":null}},\"createdAt\":\"2026-05-14T18:57:21.733Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-08-26T20:23:39.408Z\",\"publishedAt\":\"2026-05-19T09:29:39.559Z\",\"featuredAt\":null,\"reported\":false,\"approvedAt\":null,\"type\":\"vector\",\"attributes\":{\"url\":\"https://framer.com/m/Arrow-Right-G7FGkD.js@KF3XKw9NHjrWHTHfkDrj\",\"price\":null,\"paymentUrl\":null,\"vectorCount\":64,\"categories\":[{\"id\":\"3535507e-b041-4f48-be7f-a084b14e30b2\",\"name\":\"Icons\",\"slug\":\"icons\"}]}},{\"id\":\"GH6vYi7HRP8pSsslW0Cj\",\"resolved\":true,\"title\":\"eComm illustrations\",\"body\":\"\u003cp\u003eClean, modern collection of \u003cstrong\u003eeCommerce icons\u003c/strong\u003e designed to elevate your Framer projects. Featuring a consistent two-tone style, these icons bring clarity and visual balance to online store interfaces, product pages, and marketing layouts.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eDelivered in \u003cstrong\u003eSVG vector format\u003c/strong\u003e — fully scalable and lightweight\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eTwo-color system\u003c/strong\u003e for a minimal and contemporary look\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eFully \u003cstrong\u003eeditable and customizable\u003c/strong\u003e — adjust stroke weight and colors effortlessly\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003ePerfect for \u003cstrong\u003eonline shops, marketplaces, product dashboards, and checkout flows\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\",\"bodyJson\":null,\"introduction\":\"Two-tone eCommerce icon set in vector format. Fully editable and customizable for any Framer project.\",\"slug\":\"ecomm-illustrations\",\"author\":{\"framerUserId\":\"13fa5693-142d-43c8-aa0c-fb34b53777b8\",\"name\":\"Jakub\",\"slug\":\"hupka\",\"avatar\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/creators/29383/_L3A2065-oLJ9a0YuSGG0nfXndc690Bq0VxVQ5s.png\",\"followed\":false,\"followsYou\":false},\"media\":[{\"type\":\"image\",\"url\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/vector-sets/ecomm-illustrations/hndmeiw0-6Fx0CihXZA9qLYsk36K42mFaG2suNl\",\"metadata\":{\"tint\":\"hsl(0 0% 57%)\",\"aspectRatio\":1.3333333333333333}},{\"type\":\"image\",\"url\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/vector-sets/ecomm-illustrations/s11p5eng-porah4xSGwTeiPdXkhkUvp96d2DQdy\",\"metadata\":{\"tint\":\"hsl(0 0% 57%)\",\"aspectRatio\":1.3333333333333333}}],\"post\":{\"id\":\"019a5966-3cb4-70ca-9d84-adf132c152ad\",\"bodyJson\":null,\"likes\":{\"count\":5,\"liked\":false},\"comments\":{\"count\":0},\"reposts\":{\"count\":0,\"reposted\":false,\"repostId\":null}},\"createdAt\":\"2025-10-29T11:15:04.776Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2025-11-06T13:41:03.796Z\",\"publishedAt\":\"2025-11-06T13:41:03.796Z\",\"featuredAt\":null,\"reported\":false,\"approvedAt\":null,\"type\":\"vector\",\"attributes\":{\"url\":null,\"price\":\"8\",\"paymentUrl\":\"https://jakubhupka.lemonsqueezy.com/buy/8e392420-e6d4-4d4f-9749-f2ff5ae26ad8\",\"vectorCount\":8,\"categories\":[{\"id\":\"65fa91ad-4375-40c0-8b72-1cc71f2f4000\",\"name\":\"Business\",\"slug\":\"business\"}]}},{\"id\":\"qtvV74ssZ1qGQ7xrfDwX\",\"resolved\":true,\"title\":\"Azardam Social Icons\",\"body\":\"$60\",\"bodyJson\":{\"type\":\"doc\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\