",\"bodyJson\":null,\"likes\":{\"count\":15,\"liked\":false},\"comments\":{\"count\":0},\"reposts\":{\"count\":0,\"reposted\":false,\"repostId\":null}},\"createdAt\":\"2026-03-12T03:29:53.979Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-03-12T09:56:57.892Z\",\"publishedAt\":\"2026-03-12T09:56:57.892Z\",\"featuredAt\":null,\"reported\":false,\"approvedAt\":null,\"type\":\"vector\",\"attributes\":{\"url\":\"https://framer.com/m/Nourico-wtT4iM.js@lekg8ENF4q8oYrv2Z2oV\",\"price\":null,\"paymentUrl\":null,\"vectorCount\":145,\"categories\":[{\"id\":\"3535507e-b041-4f48-be7f-a084b14e30b2\",\"name\":\"Icons\",\"slug\":\"icons\"}]}},{\"id\":\"uD3cY0WCqDSibfktBfdO\",\"resolved\":true,\"title\":\"Dashboard UI\",\"body\":\"$62\",\"bodyJson\":null,\"introduction\":\"40 premium developer icons for dev tools \u0026 docs. Code, Git, terminal, API, infrastructure \u0026 debugging. Customizable colors, 2px stroke, 24×24 grid.\",\"slug\":\"dashboard-ui\",\"author\":{\"framerUserId\":\"156e1206-7256-4bd6-9cd4-bb73d281a1e7\",\"name\":\"Abdul Sami\",\"slug\":\"abdul-sami-pro\",\"avatar\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/media/156e1206-7256-4bd6-9cd4-bb73d281a1e7/5zctttjc\",\"followed\":false,\"followsYou\":false},\"media\":[{\"type\":\"image\",\"url\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/vector-sets/dashboard-ui/vumjqdq6-togTplDG7OXABwYFtRDGlCFRhMkkYj\",\"metadata\":{\"tint\":\"hsl(0 0% 3%)\",\"aspectRatio\":1.3333333333333333}},{\"type\":\"image\",\"url\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/vector-sets/dashboard-ui/u26sa0p1-84LFISg9TULGhGi4l7A1bJ8vIsXcN4\",\"metadata\":{\"tint\":\"hsl(0 0% 57%)\",\"aspectRatio\":1.3333333333333333}}],\"post\":{\"id\":\"019bc2e5-5b87-70f7-b2a5-35e434835bd3\",\"bodyJson\":null,\"likes\":{\"count\":4,\"liked\":false},\"comments\":{\"count\":0},\"reposts\":{\"count\":0,\"reposted\":false,\"repostId\":null}},\"createdAt\":\"2026-01-02T04:46:17.411Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-02-26T07:10:37.176Z\",\"publishedAt\":\"2026-01-15T18:22:49.735Z\",\"featuredAt\":null,\"reported\":false,\"approvedAt\":null,\"type\":\"vector\",\"attributes\":{\"url\":null,\"price\":\"15\",\"paymentUrl\":\"https://isimsizler.lemonsqueezy.com/checkout/buy/49e9db83-c8da-4f8a-90c5-263a7aca550f\",\"vectorCount\":40,\"categories\":[{\"id\":\"f19d9304-799a-47fb-ac52-f674ddec35f1\",\"name\":\"Technology\",\"slug\":\"technology\"}]}},{\"id\":\"xcwE7xWoiaB7MUYH7uQW\",\"resolved\":true,\"title\":\"Foll😉wee\",\"body\":\"\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e8 social platform icons built on framersmart\u0026#39;s Splash Marks technique:\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eOne optimized path per icon, glyph carved as negative space, no strokes or nested groups. Brand-accurate colors, tested and verified legible. With one solid fill, so you can recolor instantly using Framer\u0026#39;s native fill or variable controls.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eWhat\u0026#39;s included:\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e– 8 unique icons: X, WhatsApp, Instagram, YouTube, Discord, GitHub, Snapchat y Telegram.\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e– Native Framer Vector Set — drag straight onto your canvas\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e– Lightweight, fully scalable single-path SVGs (crisp at any size, tested and legible from 24px up)\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e– One fill color per icon for instant, one-click recoloring\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eFrom 24px up — ready for footers, contact sections, buttons, profile links and status badges.  \u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eIdeal for any pixel perfect, thinking out of the box design you have in mind.\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\",\"bodyJson\":{\"type\":\"doc\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"8 social platform icons built on framersmart's Splash Marks technique:\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"One optimized path per icon, glyph carved as negative space, no strokes or nested groups. Brand-accurate colors, tested and verified legible. With one solid fill, so you can recolor instantly using Framer's native fill or variable controls.\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"What's included:\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"– 8 unique icons: X, WhatsApp, Instagram, YouTube, Discord, GitHub, Snapchat y Telegram.\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"– Native Framer Vector Set — drag straight onto your canvas\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"– Lightweight, fully scalable single-path SVGs (crisp at any size, tested and legible from 24px up)\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"– One fill color per icon for instant, one-click recoloring\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"From 24px up — ready for footers, contact sections, buttons, profile links and status badges.  \"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Ideal for any pixel perfect, thinking out of the box design you have in mind.\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]}]}]},\"introduction\":\"8 social icons - your most-used\",\"slug\":\"foll-wee\",\"author\":{\"framerUserId\":\"c039868d-3492-4060-bfca-237fcf6e9545\",\"name\":\"framersmart team\",\"slug\":\"framersmart-team\",\"avatar\":null,\"followed\":false,\"followsYou\":false},\"media\":[{\"type\":\"image\",\"url\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storag