3e to easily match your project’s palette\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eIdeal for \u003cstrong\u003eorganic brands, food startups, wellness pages, and minimalist UI\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eMade for \u003cstrong\u003eFramer\u003c/strong\u003e, and compatible with \u003cstrong\u003eFigma, Illustrator, or any vector tool.\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\",\"bodyJson\":null,\"introduction\":\"A clean and modern collection of 20 line-art illustrations of fruits and vegetables\",\"slug\":\"fruits-and-veggies\",\"author\":{\"framerUserId\":\"13fa5693-142d-43c8-aa0c-fb34b53777b8\",\"name\":\"Jakub\",\"slug\":\"hupka\",\"avatar\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/creators/29383/_L3A2065-oLJ9a0YuSGG0nfXndc690Bq0VxVQ5s.png\",\"followed\":false,\"followsYou\":false},\"media\":[{\"type\":\"image\",\"url\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/vector-sets/fruits-and-veggies/hyyvp4b3-mPOTG57auB0u7CKM2cb8T2pYo51cUY\",\"metadata\":{\"tint\":\"hsl(186 91% 17%)\",\"aspectRatio\":1.3333333333333333}},{\"type\":\"image\",\"url\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/vector-sets/fruits-and-veggies/1i8h2wpv-YYcu4SodBfHhZTcv0QKJxdJdOny3Bv\"},{\"type\":\"image\",\"url\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/vector-sets/fruits-and-veggies/kzxza3g7-q5UpGTzjCLlHWFxSHxoMbC2yw42ojl\",\"metadata\":{\"tint\":\"hsl(120 53% 43%)\",\"aspectRatio\":1.3333333333333333}},{\"type\":\"image\",\"url\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/vector-sets/fruits-and-veggies/554217l3-lDbWWGJ9g9RmXk2DGaoWpFBIR5QAHs\",\"metadata\":{\"tint\":\"hsl(120 53% 43%)\",\"aspectRatio\":1.3333333333333333}}],\"post\":{\"id\":\"019a0625-9766-7699-b6ae-aed351f9f611\",\"bodyJson\":null,\"likes\":{\"count\":3,\"liked\":false},\"comments\":{\"count\":0},\"reposts\":{\"count\":0,\"reposted\":false,\"repostId\":null}},\"createdAt\":\"2025-10-17T11:26:34.193Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2025-10-21T09:41:58.246Z\",\"publishedAt\":\"2025-10-21T09:41:58.246Z\",\"featuredAt\":null,\"reported\":false,\"approvedAt\":null,\"type\":\"vector\",\"attributes\":{\"url\":null,\"price\":\"5\",\"paymentUrl\":\"https://jakubhupka.lemonsqueezy.com/buy/b89a01e7-ab1f-4513-a23d-03fd2455268f\",\"vectorCount\":20,\"categories\":[{\"id\":\"78e55a4a-220e-474c-9a7f-690f940cb1de\",\"name\":\"Illustrations\",\"slug\":\"illustrations\"}]}},{\"id\":\"RqsqXthtbSYgHUWIALZQ\",\"resolved\":true,\"title\":\"Business \u0026 Tech Pro\",\"body\":\"$67\",\"bodyJson\":{\"type\":\"doc\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Business \u0026 Tech Pro: The Essential Icon Set for Modern Interfaces\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" \"},{\"type\":\"emoji\",\"attrs\":{\"name\":\"briefcase\",\"emoji\":\"💼\"}},{\"type\":\"emoji\",\"attrs\":{\"name\":\"sparkles\",\"emoji\":\"✨\"}}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Elevate your digital products with \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Business \u0026 Tech Pro\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"—a meticulously crafted collection of 40 Framer-ready vector icons designed specifically for the complex interfaces that modern teams build every single day. Whether you are designing for robust SaaS platforms, secure fintech applications, or high-end agency portals, this set provides the visual clarity and professionalism your projects demand.\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"emoji\",\"attrs\":{\"name\":\"sparkles\",\"emoji\":\"✨\"}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" Core Features \u0026 Benefits:\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"bulletList\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"emoji\",\"attrs\":{\"name\":\"straight_ruler\",\"emoji\":\"📏\"}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Precision Engineered:\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" Every single icon is drawn on a strict, consistent 24px grid, guaranteeing a crisp, dependable, and pixel-perfect appearance across all your product pages, complex dashboards, and client portals.\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"emoji\",\"attrs\":{\"name\":\"gear\",\"emoji\":\"⚙\"}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Total Customization:\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" Built for ultimate flexibility in Framer. With fully adjustable stroke weights and native \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"currentColor\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"code\"}]},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" styling, you can effortlessly tune and adapt the entire collection to perfectly match any brand identity, color palette, or dark/light theme.\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"emoji\",\"attrs\":{\"name\":\"card_index_dividers\",\"emoji\":\"🗂\"}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Comprehensive Categories:\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" Stop wasting hours redrawing the basics. This set covers all your essential business and tech needs—seamlessly representing invoices, secure payments, and data reporting, right through to marketing funnels, server infrastructure, cybersecurity, and intricate workflow states.\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"emoji\",\"attrs\":{\"name\":\"mag\",\"emoji\":\"🔍\"}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Built-in Specimen View:\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" An interactive gallery allows you to easily browse the complete collection, preview how the icons scale in real-time, and copy your selections directly into your active Framer workspace with absolutely zero friction.\"}]}]}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"It is the perfect, polished starter set designed to help you ship clearer, more intuitive product experiences while saving you valuable time. Give your next digital project the sharp, consistent visual language it deserves! \"},{\"type\":\"emoji\",\"attrs\":{\"name\":\"rocket\",\"emoji\":\"🚀\"}}]}]},\"introduction\":\"40 icons for business and tech wor\",\"slug\":\"business-tech-pro\",\"author\":{\"framerUserId\":\"156e1206-7256-4bd6-9cd4-bb73d281a1e7\",\"name\":\"Abdul Sami\",\"slug\":\"abdul-sami-pro\",\"avatar\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/media/156e1206-7256-4bd6-9cd4-bb73d281a1e7/5zctttjc\",\"followed\":false,\"followsYou\":false},\"media\":[{\"type\":\"image\",\"url\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/media/156e1206-7256-4bd6-9cd4-bb73d281a1e7/01a03d56-7c83-77e3-84e8-2f75561207e1.png\",\"metadata\":{\"tint\":\"hsl(0 0% 3%)\",\"aspectRatio\":1.25402635431918}},{\"type\":\"image\",\"url\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/media/156e1206-7256-4bd6-9cd4-bb73d281a1e7/01a03d56-8acf-77b9-9c2f-d22c592abf64.png\",\"metadata\":{\"tint\":\"hsl(0 0% 3%)\",\"aspectRatio\":0.7218376337319069}}],\"post\":{\"id\":\"01a03d59-7c80-7057-a4f3-fc053c59c761\",\"bodyJson\":{\"type\":\"doc\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"emoji\",\"attrs\":{\"name\":\"briefcase\",\"emoji\":\"💼\"}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" Upgrade your SaaS and Fintech layouts with \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Business \u0026 Tech Pro\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"!\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"A focused set of 40 Framer-ready vector icons built for modern interfaces. \"},{\"type\":\"emoji\",\"attrs\":{\"name\":\"rocket\",\"emoji\":\"🚀\"}}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\