, butterflies, and charming decorative shapes. Designed with expressive outlines, subtle dimensional details, and a soft pink-and-blue pastel palette.\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Perfect for websites, landing pages, lifestyle brands, beauty projects, social media, packaging, and creative digital products.\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"12 unique vectors · Fully scalable · Easy to recolor · Ready for creative projects\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Tags:\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"vector, pastel, illustration, doodle, hand drawn, cute, playful, flower, butterfly, pink, blue, feminine, retro, decorative\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"code\"}]}]}]},\"introduction\":\"12 Hand-Drawn Vector Illustrations\",\"slug\":\"pastel-trinkets\",\"author\":{\"framerUserId\":\"459d0622-8968-4406-9466-b4251fe0f4c7\",\"name\":\"Aniatun Lina\",\"slug\":\"aniatunlina\",\"avatar\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/media/459d0622-8968-4406-9466-b4251fe0f4c7/pcmyntcc\",\"followed\":false,\"followsYou\":false},\"media\":[{\"type\":\"image\",\"url\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/media/459d0622-8968-4406-9466-b4251fe0f4c7/019fdb60-0f38-713d-aa38-795552d5bf67.png\",\"metadata\":{\"tint\":\"hsl(60 53% 39%)\",\"aspectRatio\":1}},{\"type\":\"image\",\"url\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/media/459d0622-8968-4406-9466-b4251fe0f4c7/019fdb62-2fb9-72af-9b4f-3bcfc0b15947.png\",\"metadata\":{\"tint\":\"hsl(0 0% 57%)\",\"aspectRatio\":1.3333333333333333}}],\"post\":{\"id\":\"019fdb65-238d-7448-bad3-0d9186f82e3c\",\"bodyJson\":{\"type\":\"doc\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Introducing Pastel Trinkets  \",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Collection of 12 hand-drawn vectors with soft pastel colors and playful details. Designed for websites, branding, and creative projects.\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" ✿\"}]}]},\"likes\":{\"count\":10,\"liked\":false},\"comments\":{\"count\":0},\"reposts\":{\"count\":0,\"reposted\":false,\"repostId\":null}},\"createdAt\":\"2026-08-07T08:44:25.955Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-08-07T08:44:25.955Z\",\"publishedAt\":\"2026-08-07T08:44:25.950Z\",\"featuredAt\":null,\"reported\":false,\"approvedAt\":null,\"type\":\"vector\",\"attributes\":{\"url\":\"https://framer.com/m/clips-1-3ygcJb.js@AWB9jPx20Fm5Yitg8VBg\",\"price\":null,\"paymentUrl\":null,\"vectorCount\":12,\"categories\":[{\"id\":\"78e55a4a-220e-474c-9a7f-690f940cb1de\",\"name\":\"Illustrations\",\"slug\":\"illustrations\"}]}},{\"id\":\"UK2Vob3StubZFtix3cry\",\"resolved\":true,\"title\":\"Doodle Characters\",\"body\":\"\u003cp\u003eEasily add these Doodle Characters to your Framer project with this vector set. Find and customize characters effortlessly. Adjust the body skin color, clothes, and stroke color—all in vectorized SVG format.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch2\u003eCustomizable Properties\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eChange body skin color\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eChange stroke color\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eChange clothes colors\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\",\"bodyJson\":null,\"introduction\":\"49 clean line art doodle-style character illustrations available in SVG vector format. You can easily change the body skin color, clothes, and stroke color.\",\"slug\":\"doodle\",\"author\":{\"framerUserId\":\"3e5e71d1-2797-4aea-832e-396f539086c1\",\"name\":\"Solt Wagner\",\"slug\":\"solt\",\"avatar\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/creators/34897/avatar-Dw7Es90hZZxtV6exw82xl2AlEAFD6x.jpg\",\"followed\":false,\"followsYou\":false},\"media\":[{\"type\":\"image\",\"url\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/vector-sets/doodle/op7r4bsp-aJaeJuTFIT0vFD49eMBUZHHw0BHIjp\",\"metadata\":{\"tint\":\"hsl(60 53% 39%)\",\"aspectRatio\":1.3333333333333333}},{\"type\":\"image\",\"url\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/vector-sets/doodle/fuvgg6qh-4p7902HkU0mnmIOPT5vZYM3IExpYIf\",\"metadata\":{\"tint\":\"hsl(60 53% 39%)\",\"aspectRatio\":1.3333333333333333}},{\"type\":\"image\",\"url\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/vector-sets/doodle/kw4endra-StOUZxtLAVimCtt9zGFsD1pdhlXC6o\",\"metadata\":{\"tint\":\"hsl(60 53% 39%)\",\"aspectRatio\":1.3333333333333333}}],\"post\":{\"id\":\"01999ff1-65f7-73d5-8f3f-8e6590402273\",\"bodyJson\":null,\"likes\":{\"count\":7,\"liked\":false},\"comments\":{\"count\":0},\"reposts\":{\"count\":0,\"reposted\":false,\"repostId\":null}},\"createdAt\":\"2025-10-01T12:39:11.825Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2025-10-01T13:23:41.687Z\",\"publishedAt\":\"2025-10-01T13:23:41.687Z\",\"featuredAt\":null,\"reported\":false,\"approvedAt\":null,\"type\":\"vector\",\"attributes\":{\"url\":null,\"price\":\"9\",\"paymentUrl\":\"https://frameblox.lemonsqueezy.com/buy/6f973f3a-91b8-4050-be7a-a06c866096ff\",\"vectorCount\":49,\"categories\":[{\"id\":\"78e55a4a-220e-474c-9a7f-690f940cb1de\",\"name\":\"Illustrations\",\"slug\":\"illustrations\"}]}},{\"id\":\"4v2HvbKbBVik4hCxcnjZ\",\"resolved\":true,\"title\":\"Download\",\"body\":\"\u003cp\u003eThis App Download Badge Set brings together clarity, consistency, and thoughtful design to enhance the way your product is presented. Each badge is crafted with smooth geometry, balanced spacing, and a modern visual tone that instantly strengthens trust and improves the user experience.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eWhether you are launching a new app, refining a landing page, or shaping a complete product interface, these badges help communicate platform availability with confidence.Windows, App Store, Google Play, App Gallery, Amazon, Spotify, and Youtube are all unified in a single, polished style that feels both professional and welcoming.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eElegant. Reliable. Conversion focused.A small design element that adds a noticeably elevated and meaningful touch to your Framer projects.\u003c/p\u003e\",\"bodyJson\":null,\"introduction\":\"A clean and beautifully crafted set of app download badges designed to elevate your product pages with clarity, trust, and a refined professional touch.\",\"slug\":\"download\",\"author\":{\"framerUserId\":\"4b3a773d-065c-4edd-b489-790ae6cbb82e\",\"name\":\"HD Design\",\"slug\":\"hddesign\",\"avatar\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/creators/1142791/avatar-O68YHVSWjcTg7NToc7iBxCZY2nZ7UJ.jpg\",\"followed\":false,\"followsYou\":false},\"media\":[{\"type\":\"image\",\"url\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/vector-sets/download/kt79a24z-w2b21HE2C94KL2nprrLQBnovuNr0gM\",\"metadata\":{\"tint\":\"hsl(0 0% 57%)\",\"aspectRatio\":1.3333333333333333}},{\"type\":\"image\",\"url\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/vector-sets/download/qhj3e5ov-0GWULcomHKKHwpmktQF8Gi9WJBZ4qc\",\"metadata\":{\"tint\":\"hsl(0 0% 57%)\",\"aspectRatio\":1.3333333333333333}}],\"post\":{\"id\":\"019aa61f-2546-7880-aa53-48f292c11109\",\"bodyJson\":null,\"likes\":{\"count\":18,\"liked\":false},\"comments\":{\"count\":0},\"reposts\":{\"count\":0,\"reposted\":false,\"repostId\":null}},\"createdAt\":\"2025-11-14T14:05:18.741Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2025-11-21T11:14:10.374Z\",\"publishedAt\":\"2025-11-21T11:14:10.374Z\",\"featuredAt\":null,\"reported\":false,\"approvedAt\":null,\"type\":\"vector\",\"attributes\":{\"url\":\"https://framer.com/m/Amazon-Vuj2.js@cGvZmFW8etVBTGd2yQgE\",\"price\":null,\"paymentUrl\":null,\"vectorCount\":7,\"categories\":[{\"id\":\"f19d9304-799a-47fb-ac52-f674ddec35f1\",\"name\":\"Technology\",\"slug\":\"technology\"}]}},{\"id\":\"coZk7jKV4P1S6OS3DwKu\",\"resolved\":true,\"title\":\"US States Vector\",\"body\":\"$69\",\"bodyJson\":{\"type\":\"doc\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"US States Vector Silhouette Pack\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"A comprehensive, high-precision vector collection of all 50 US state geographic silhouettes plus Washington D.C. and a complete nationwide map graphic. Created by Karim Saif, this asset set offers clean, scalable vector outlines built for interactive web maps, infographics, travel platforms, and regional UI dashboards.\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"emoji\",\"attrs\":{\"name\":\"milky_way\",\"emoji\":\"🌌\"}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" What It Does\"},{\"type\":\"emoji\",\"attrs\":{\"name\":\"world_map\",\"emoji\":\"🗺\"}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" Complete Geographic Coverage\"}]},{\"type\":\"bulletList\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"All 50 States + Federal District:\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" Includes individual silhouette vectors for all U.S. states (from California and Texas to Alaska and Hawaii) along with Washington D.C. and a complete U.S. nation silhouette.\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Geographically Precise Paths:\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" Detailed vector outlines capturing real geographic coastlines, state borders, panhandles, and island chains with smooth node fidelity.\"}]}]}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"emoji\",\"attrs\":{\"name\":\"triangular_ruler\",\"emoji\":\"📐\"}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" Clean Solid Silhouettes\"}]},{\"type\":\"bulletList\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Flat Vector Shapes:\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" Minimalist solid black fills designed for effortless styling, hover-state color shifts, and seamless visual integration across dark and light UI themes.\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Uniform \u0026 Scalable:\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" Pixel-perfect vector boundaries optimized for ultra-crisp rendering at small icon scales as well as large hero-section visual displays.\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"emoji\",\"attrs\":{\"name\":\"rocket\",\"emoji\":\"🚀\"}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" Best Used For\"}]},{\"type\":\"bulletList\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"emoji\",\"attrs\":{\"name\":\"round_pushpin\",\"emoji\":\"📍\"}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" Interactive store locators, real estate platforms, and shipping region selectors\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"emoji\",\"attrs\":{\"name\":\"bar_chart\",\"emoji\":\"📊\"}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" Infographics, election visualizers, and data analytics dashboards\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"emoji\",\"attrs\":{\"name\":\"airplane\",\"emoji\":\"✈\"}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" Travel blogs, tourism portals, and regional service directories\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"emoji\",\"attrs\":{\"name\":\"iphone\",\"emoji\":\"📱\"}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" Mobile app state selection interfaces and geographical filtering systems\"}]}]}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Made with \"},{\"type\":\"emoji\",\"attrs\":{\"name\":\"yellow_heart\",\"emoji\":\"💛\"}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" by \"},{\"type\":\"mention\",\"attrs\":{\"id\":\"cdbd7ebc-86d4-4b64-baea-421f236c7c35\",\"slug\":\"karim-saif\",\"label\":\"Karim Saif\",\"mentionSuggestionChar\":\"@\"}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" \"}]}]},\"introduction\":\"US state geographic silhouettes\",\"slug\":\"us-states-vector\",\"author\":{\"framerUserId\":\"cdbd7ebc-86d4-4b64-baea-421f236c7c35\",\"name\":\"Karim Saif\",\"slug\":\"karim-saif\",\"avatar\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/creators/38316/JKMR4LgEt-1ogBJEJjcXu0BLVSwyn9DCkQ64JbBx\",\"followed\":false,\"followsYou\":false},\"media\":[{\"type\":\"image\",\"url\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/media/cdbd7ebc-86d4-4b64-baea-421f236c7c35/019fb427-ca9b-74a8-af67-a8ca7a3c3d79.png\",\"metadata\":{\"tint\":\"hsl(300 38% 62%)\",\"aspectRatio\":1.3437094682230868}},{\"type\":\"image\",\"url\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/media/cdbd7ebc-86d4-4b64-baea-421f236c7c35/019fb428-56cc-73e8-a82b-9b701cd30b6b.png\",\"metadata\":{\"tint\":\"hsl(216 67% 24%)\",\"aspectRatio\":1.5246113989637307}},{\"type\":\"image\",\"url\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/media/cdbd7ebc-86d4-4b64-baea-421f236c7c35/019fb428-0fdb-73cf-b3b9-edf8e81de561.png\",\"metadata\":{\"tint\":\"hsl(270 70% 70%)\",\"aspectRatio\":1.344155844155844}}],\"post\":{\"id\":\"019fb429-1bd1-7538-a86e-4756ccd3c639\",\"bodyJson\":{\"type\":\"doc\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"US States Vector Silhouette Pack\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"his asset set offers clean, scalable vector outlines built for interactive web maps, infographics, travel platforms, and regional UI dashboards.\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"emoji\",\"attrs\":{\"name\":\"art\",\"emoji\":\"🎨\"}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" Design Features\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Resolution Independent:\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" Pure vector shapes that scale infinitely without quality loss or raster pixelation.\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Customizable Styling:\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" Easily adjust fill colors, stroke overlays, hover interactions, or opacity levels in Framer, Figma, or CSS.\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Modular Layout:\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" Each state is crafted as an independent vector asset for flexible grid visual displays or standalone interactive map elements.\"}]}]},\"likes\":{\"count\":4,\"liked\":false},\"comments\":{\"count\":0},\"reposts\":{\"count\":0,\"reposted\":false,\"repostId\":null}},\"createdAt\":\"2026-07-30T17:53:40.355Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-07-30T17:54:35.903Z\",\"publishedAt\":\"2026-07-30T17:53:40.349Z\",\"featuredAt\":null,\"reported\":false,\"approvedAt\":null,\"type\":\"vector\",\"attributes\":{\"url\":null,\"price\":\"5\",\"paymentUrl\":\"https://karimsaif.lemonsqueezy.com/checkout\",\"vectorCount\":52,\"categories\":[{\"id\":\"4f84719e-313e-4bd5-8f3b-f4f2581f27bd\",\"name\":\"Flags\",\"slug\":\"flags\"}]}},{\"id\":\"yczIXx0qOWBj70KNoRnu\",\"resolved\":true,\"title\":\"Travel \u0026 Maps\",\"body\":\"\u003cp\u003eA set of icons for tourism, maps or adventures.The set includes symbols for \u003cstrong\u003eactivities\u003c/strong\u003e such as kayaking, surfing, cycling, trekking and climbing, as well as icons representing \u003cstrong\u003eplaces and services\u003c/strong\u003e like restaurants, accommodation, airports, parking areas and heritage spots. It also covers \u003cstrong\u003enavigation and orientation\u003c/strong\u003e elements like starting points, guided tours, viewpoints, valleys, villages, and mountains.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe style is clean and timeless — combining modern simplicity with a subtle nod to mid-century cartographic design. The consistent stroke weight and limited color palette make it ideal for \u003cstrong\u003eprinted maps, digital applications, signage or tourism branding systems\u003c/strong\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eDesigned to be \u003cstrong\u003escalable and versatile\u003c/strong\u003e, this icon family brings clarity and character to any travel or adventure project — from destination guides to outdoor experiences and cultural routes.\u003c/p\u003e\",\"bodyJson\":null,\"introduction\":\"Tourism, maps or adventures.\",\"slug\":\"travel-maps\",\"author\":{\"framerUserId\":\"2186e148-007b-4fa6-bc15-fd97d4b1b61b\",\"name\":\"Luis Curti\",\"slug\":\"luis-curti\",\"avatar\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/creators/86748/qB5VNaO3l-Q2X3ICecNQT7fJx6JS1mQz84vRce4y\",\"badges\":[\"pro\"],\"followed\":false,\"followsYou\":false},\"media\":[{\"type\":\"image\",\"url\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/vector-sets/travel-maps/ofzdd2io-AYdfVNMtvL4LLR0FvzGDnhADPvxjb3\",\"metadata\":{\"tint\":\"hsl(60 53% 39%)\",\"aspectRatio\":1.3333333333333333}},{\"type\":\"image\",\"url\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/vector-sets/travel-maps/opwscs8x-ArBPpAwt7D2v7rkBMJs9dcFR1ef0r7\",\"metadata\":{\"tint\":\"hsl(60 53% 39%)\",\"aspectRatio\":1.3333333333333333}}],\"post\":{\"id\":\"019a4520-19ba-730e-b4d6-5b74b49e28d9\",\"bodyJson\":null,\"likes\":{\"count\":7,\"liked\":false},\"comments\":{\"count\":0},\"reposts\":{\"count\":0,\"reposted\":false,\"repostId\":null}},\"createdAt\":\"2025-10-19T12:40:47.334Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-07-11T18:10:24.060Z\",\"publishedAt\":\"2025-11-02T15:12:03.002Z\",\"featuredAt\":null,\"reported\":false,\"approvedAt\":null,\"type\":\"vector\",\"attributes\":{\"url\":null,\"price\":\"1\",\"paymentUrl\":\"https://buy.stripe.com/dRmcN5av4bKQ5r13o52Nq0a\",\"vectorCount\":30,\"categories\":[{\"id\":\"7e6e2aca-859c-43af-a4c8-39e8d343ced6\",\"name\":\"Lifestyle\",\"slug\":\"lifestyle\"}]}},{\"id\":\"THgLHfK8oy345mHobQaz\",\"resolved\":true,\"title\":\"logonest\",\"body\":\"\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eLogoNest Shapes\u003c/strong\u003e is a curated collection of modern, abstract, and geometric SVG logo shapes designed for branding, startups, SaaS products, and creative projects.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eEach shape is clean, scalable, and easy to customise inside \u003cstrong\u003eFramer\u003c/strong\u003e. Perfect for logo exploration, hero sections, brand marks, and visual identity systems.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eLive preview available at: \u003ca target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\\\" href=\\\"https://loogo.framer.website/\\\"\u003eLogonest\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003eWhat’s Included\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e80+ abstract \u0026amp; geometric SVG shapes\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eRounded, minimal \u0026amp; modern styles\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eUnique logo-ready compositions\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eHigh-contrast \u0026amp; colour-friendly designs\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003ch3\u003eFeatures\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eFully scalable SVG vectors\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eEasy color \u0026amp; size customization\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eOptimised for Framer\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eClean, modern \u0026amp; minimal design\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eWorks on light \u0026amp; dark backgrounds\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\",\"bodyJson\":null,\"introduction\":\"Collection of modern, abstract, and geometric SVG logos\",\"slug\":\"logonest\",\"author\":{\"framerUserId\":\"17a29a78-9597-44c5-b438-6b9e6f2028f1\",\"name\":\"Sandy\",\"slug\":\"sandyuiux\",\"avatar\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/creators/260792/avatar-er79IieurSSuYOVhpWUOmSMPcrNeWD.jpg\",\"followed\":false,\"followsYou\":false},\"media\":[{\"type\":\"image\",\"url\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/vector-sets/logonest/heb7w0ug-XSVXW1kghy3fVzA5VpVSV4sEeFFebF\",\"metadata\":{\"tint\":\"hsl(0 0% 9%)\",\"aspectRatio\":1.3333333333333333}},{\"type\":\"image\",\"url\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/vector-sets/logonest/8uhb4u2h-leGY5yiHUntJyc4IIN1bJCh1TNmWQh\",\"metadata\":{\"tint\":\"hsl(0 0% 9%)\",\"aspectRatio\":1.3333333333333333}},{\"type\":\"image\",\"url\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/vector-sets/logonest/wbh6lt9y-6F72wCxbYPn2VIoUkiPD5HjhOygA2k\"}],\"post\":{\"id\":\"019c0c5a-77c0-7560-89ac-684146cd43a2\",\"bodyJson\":null,\"likes\":{\"count\":15,\"liked\":false},\"comments\":{\"count\":1},\"reposts\":{\"count\":0,\"reposted\":false,\"repostId\":null}},\"createdAt\":\"2026-01-22T09:39:19.823Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-02-06T15:07:58.967Z\",\"publishedAt\":\"2026-01-30T00:43:01.440Z\",\"featuredAt\":null,\"reported\":false,\"approvedAt\":null,\"type\":\"vector\",\"attributes\":{\"url\":\"https://framer.com/m/Logomark-1-0oHGJN.js@zLvafFLvyzR87M9pBspY\",\"price\":null,\"paymentUrl\":null,\"vectorCount\":90,\"categories\":[{\"id\":\"fa19b5a7-a3be-4f68-9ba4-25800d07d1a3\",\"name\":\"Logos\",\"slug\":\"logos\"}]}},{\"id\":\"gmVdApIcKSQBcju9vqfB\",\"resolved\":true,\"title\":\"Hand Gestures\",\"body\":\"\u003cp\u003eGesture Set is a collection of 10 vector hand illustrations made to add personality and warmth to your projects. Each gesture is simple, modern, and adaptable. You can easily edit sleeve and outline colors to match your brand, keeping a consistent look across your site or app.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003ePerfect for landing pages, hero sections, product details, or illustrations where you want a friendly, human touch without losing a clean design style. Due to the digital nature of the files, all sales are final. No returns or refunds are offered.\u003c/p\u003e\",\"bodyJson\":null,\"introduction\":\"A set of 10 playful hand gesture vectors that add warmth and personality to any design. Fully editable and easy to match with your brand.\",\"slug\":\"gesture-set\",\"author\":{\"framerUserId\":\"2a425ad9-c342-4590-af3c-88a1f3875e22\",\"name\":\"Sanna Granqvist\",\"slug\":\"sanna-granqvist\",\"avatar\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/media/2a425ad9-c342-4590-af3c-88a1f3875e22/a2khusgj\",\"badges\":[\"pro\"],\"followed\":false,\"followsYou\":false},\"media\":[{\"type\":\"image\",\"url\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/vector-sets/gesture-set/m2d6g100-FfaMbDZmutnNWgUCM6WZvYbo4yl5tx\",\"metadata\":{\"tint\":\"hsl(0 0% 57%)\",\"aspectRatio\":1.3333333333333333}},{\"type\":\"image\",\"url\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/vector-sets/gesture-set/1ukr3b8k-xNbgAX4f9zh7TsacAsdm0JLxyzZYBt\",\"metadata\":{\"tint\":\"hsl(0 0% 57%)\",\"aspectRatio\":1.3333333333333333}}],\"post\":{\"id\":\"0199dfb2-14b8-768d-a17b-927120c66afb\",\"bodyJson\":null,\"likes\":{\"count\":20,\"liked\":false},\"comments\":{\"count\":0},\"reposts\":{\"count\":0,\"reposted\":false,\"repostId\":null}},\"createdAt\":\"2025-10-13T18:44:04.280Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-05-03T06:47:58.979Z\",\"publishedAt\":\"2025-10-13T22:30:13.944Z\",\"featuredAt\":null,\"reported\":false,\"approvedAt\":null,\"type\":\"vector\",\"attributes\":{\"url\":\"https://framer.com/m/1-Pointing-Right-qH3W.js@VsOK0yxKkQ4vqtZCNFJf\",\"price\":null,\"paymentUrl\":null,\"vectorCount\":20,\"categories\":[{\"id\":\"78e55a4a-220e-474c-9a7f-690f940cb1de\",\"name\":\"Illustrations\",\"slug\":\"illustrations\"}]}},{\"id\":\"kdnhgI7eL2QT1nDcX9Vc\",\"resolved\":true,\"title\":\"Solar Bold Icons\",\"body\":\"$6a\",\"bodyJson\":null,\"introduction\":\"1246 beautifully craft