lection of simple black plant icons including leaves, flowers, and cacti arranged on a beige background for use in design and graphic projects.\"}]}]},\"introduction\":\"FOREX Sure\",\"slug\":\"black-plant-icons\",\"author\":{\"framerUserId\":\"e396b4ad-2e1a-4031-9873-d67b4be343a2\",\"name\":\"FOREX Suree\",\"slug\":\"forex-suree\",\"avatar\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/media/e396b4ad-2e1a-4031-9873-d67b4be343a2/g6ss5elm\",\"followed\":false,\"followsYou\":false},\"media\":[{\"type\":\"image\",\"url\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/media/e396b4ad-2e1a-4031-9873-d67b4be343a2/6ooipt5p\",\"metadata\":{\"tint\":\"hsl(30 41% 55%)\",\"aspectRatio\":1.3333333333333333}},{\"type\":\"image\",\"url\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/media/e396b4ad-2e1a-4031-9873-d67b4be343a2/szvvp5vv\",\"metadata\":{\"tint\":\"hsl(0 0% 57%)\",\"aspectRatio\":1.3333333333333333}}],\"post\":{\"id\":\"019f3058-6db9-7138-9182-409e5bd50c8f\",\"bodyJson\":{\"type\":\"doc\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Boost engagement by sharing news, promotions, milestones, or project updates directly to the community feed.\"}]}]},\"likes\":{\"count\":5,\"liked\":false},\"comments\":{\"count\":0},\"reposts\":{\"count\":0,\"reposted\":false,\"repostId\":null}},\"createdAt\":\"2026-07-05T03:35:29.417Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-07-05T03:35:29.417Z\",\"publishedAt\":\"2026-07-05T03:35:29.414Z\",\"featuredAt\":null,\"reported\":false,\"approvedAt\":null,\"type\":\"vector\",\"attributes\":{\"url\":null,\"price\":\"8\",\"paymentUrl\":\"https://buy.polar.sh/polar_cl_zHomWgJayYI7cKOaY2dz0NSfDe7gVeYoFHdpb1uuDHo\",\"vectorCount\":9,\"categories\":[{\"id\":\"3535507e-b041-4f48-be7f-a084b14e30b2\",\"name\":\"Icons\",\"slug\":\"icons\"}]}},{\"id\":\"mv84aOOJYcu5sr05jiKV\",\"resolved\":true,\"title\":\"Graph \u0026 Chart Icons\",\"body\":\"\u003cp\u003eEditable graph and chart illustrations in SVG format — including gauge, pie, polar, candlestick, and area charts. Outline and filled styles, fully customizable to fit any project.Delivered in \u003cstrong\u003eSVG vector format\u003c/strong\u003e — scalable, lightweight, and pixel-perfect\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eFlexible \u003cstrong\u003eoutline and filled styles\u003c/strong\u003e for maximum flexibility\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eFully \u003cstrong\u003ecustomizable and editable\u003c/strong\u003e — adjust colors, strokes, and fills with ease\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003ePerfect for \u003cstrong\u003edata-driven projects, startups, analytics tools, or product UI mockups\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eDesigned for \u003cstrong\u003eFramer\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\",\"bodyJson\":null,\"introduction\":\"A versatile collection of modern data visualizations designed for any Framer project. \",\"slug\":\"graph-chart-icons-set\",\"author\":{\"framerUserId\":\"13fa5693-142d-43c8-aa0c-fb34b53777b8\",\"name\":\"Jakub\",\"slug\":\"hupka\",\"avatar\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/creators/29383/_L3A2065-oLJ9a0YuSGG0nfXndc690Bq0VxVQ5s.png\",\"followed\":false,\"followsYou\":false},\"media\":[{\"type\":\"image\",\"url\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/vector-sets/graph-chart-icons-set/mfns4cue-Y0NI9nMQ51s4czWQaRxtdDLrbfKTdg\",\"metadata\":{\"tint\":\"hsl(0 0% 9%)\",\"aspectRatio\":1.3333333333333333}},{\"type\":\"image\",\"url\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/vector-sets/graph-chart-icons-set/o3t4wz0k-QwNfr26wLSOaLSUMMkg4z7gwPhNqm0\",\"metadata\":{\"tint\":\"hsl(0 0% 9%)\",\"aspectRatio\":1.3333333333333333}},{\"type\":\"image\",\"url\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/vector-sets/graph-chart-icons-set/5zbwiep0-RHEKhqZlyC1RvKhY4Yl1qEgxFeTSj7\",\"metadata\":{\"tint\":\"hsl(186 91% 17%)\",\"aspectRatio\":1.3333333333333333}}],\"post\":{\"id\":\"019a0625-66f6-78ca-8ae2-aca67fb2767f\",\"bodyJson\":null,\"likes\":{\"count\":4,\"liked\":false},\"comments\":{\"count\":0},\"reposts\":{\"count\":0,\"reposted\":false,\"repostId\":null}},\"createdAt\":\"2025-10-17T13:14:20.085Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2025-10-21T09:41:45.846Z\",\"publishedAt\":\"2025-10-21T09:41:45.846Z\",\"featuredAt\":null,\"reported\":false,\"approvedAt\":null,\"type\":\"vector\",\"attributes\":{\"url\":null,\"price\":\"8\",\"paymentUrl\":\"https://jakubhupka.lemonsqueezy.com/buy/8c1df306-d6d4-43bc-8caa-62553dc169e3\",\"vectorCount\":10,\"categories\":[{\"id\":\"65fa91ad-4375-40c0-8b72-1cc71f2f4000\",\"name\":\"Business\",\"slug\":\"business\"}]}},{\"id\":\"RE90su8PeUzJdMH9dtOL\",\"resolved\":true,\"title\":\"Company Logos\",\"body\":\"\u003cp\u003eEach icon in this collection is sourced directly from its official platform, guaranteeing authentic design and high-quality visuals\u003c/p\u003e\",\"bodyJson\":null,\"introduction\":\"Collection of Company Logos\",\"slug\":\"company-logos\",\"author\":{\"framerUserId\":\"44d81494-caac-404c-bcfa-0490266fcd89\",\"name\":\"Dject Studio\",\"slug\":\"djectstudio\",\"avatar\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/creators/99415/avatar-N7QEIfin2WdbElamtJJfIh7VRrfUpA.jpg\",\"followed\":false,\"followsYou\":false},\"media\":[{\"type\":\"image\",\"url\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/vector-sets/company-logos/vqhyv53h-XF1wcFseGWy1j1rmnG6scJOWq5QBhy\",\"metadata\":{\"tint\":\"hsl(0 0% 57%)\",\"aspectRatio\":1.3333333333333333}},{\"type\":\"image\",\"url\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/vector-sets/company-logos/i4925mst-KMvFXW7hzPeGIMQKX08jlaqa4FLc9S\",\"metadata\":{\"tint\":\"hsl(0 0% 57%)\",\"aspectRatio\":1.3333333333333333}}],\"post\":{\"id\":\"019aa187-0cc9-704f-abf8-b332d65e6d49\",\"bodyJson\":null,\"likes\":{\"count\":21,\"liked\":false},\"comments\":{\"count\":0},\"reposts\":{\"count\":0,\"reposted\":false,\"repostId\":null}},\"createdAt\":\"2025-10-10T10:45:48.078Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2025-11-20T13:49:33.769Z\",\"publishedAt\":\"2025-11-20T13:49:33.769Z\",\"featuredAt\":null,\"reported\":false,\"approvedAt\":null,\"type\":\"vector\",\"attributes\":{\"url\":\"https://framer.com/m/Intercom-Han7.js@aJC5Je2K32UBbislTg5Y\",\"price\":null,\"paymentUrl\":null,\"vectorCount\":108,\"categories\":[{\"id\":\"fa19b5a7-a3be-4f68-9ba4-25800d07d1a3\",\"name\":\"Logos\",\"slug\":\"logos\"}]}},{\"id\":\"l83LSLC2XpdBh9lvVHCh\",\"resolved\":true,\"title\":\"SaaS Illustrations\",\"body\":\"\u003cp\u003eModern SaaS \u0026amp; eCommerce illustrations in two-tone SVG format. Fully editable and minimal for any Framer project.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003esleek, minimalistic collection of \u003cstrong\u003eillustrations designed for SaaS platforms and eCommerce projects\u003c/strong\u003e. Crafted for modern product pages, dashboards, and landing sections, this set brings clarity and visual harmony to your Framer designs.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eDelivered in \u003cstrong\u003eSVG vector format\u003c/strong\u003e — scalable, lightweight, and pixel-perfect\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eTwo-color system\u003c/strong\u003e for a clean, minimal aesthetic that adapts to any brand palette\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eFully \u003cstrong\u003eeditable and customizable\u003c/strong\u003e — adjust stroke, colors, and proportions easily\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003ePerfect for \u003cstrong\u003eSaaS dashboards, online stores, startup websites, and modern UIs\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\",\"bodyJson\":null,\"introduction\":\"Modern SaaS \u0026 eCommerce illustrations in two-tone SVG format. Fully editable and minimal for any Framer project.\",\"slug\":\"saas-ecommerce-illustrations\",\"author\":{\"framerUserId\":\"13fa5693-142d-43c8-aa0c-fb34b53777b8\",\"name\":\"Jakub\",\"slug\":\"hupka\",\"avatar\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/creators/29383/_L3A2065-oLJ9a0YuSGG0nfXndc690Bq0VxVQ5s.png\",\"followed\":false,\"followsYou\":false},\"media\":[{\"type\":\"image\",\"url\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/vector-sets/saas-ecommerce-illustrations/ar8oq0l3-5I8LDX4H8bIOiAnt0W8r0mP8UJevkh\",\"metadata\":{\"tint\":\"hsl(60 53% 39%)\",\"aspectRatio\":1.3333333333333333}},{\"type\":\"image\",\"url\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/vector-sets/saas-ecommerce-illustrations/ppxxthpd-PdVqwssaslMbaZwTxZqUBWt0M4LVLG\",\"metadata\":{\"tint\":\"hsl(0 0% 57%)\",\"aspectRatio\":1.3333333333333333}}],\"post\":{\"id\":\"019a5965-05d1-7114-be5e-01154bcc2a58\",\"bodyJson\":null,\"likes\":{\"count\":3,\"liked\":false},\"comments\":{\"count\":0},\"reposts\":{\"count\":0,\"reposted\":false,\"repostId\":null}},\"createdAt\":\"2025-10-29T10:16:45.439Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2025-11-06T13:39:44.209Z\",\"publishedAt\":\"2025-11-06T13:39:44.209Z\",\"featuredAt\":null,\"reported\":false,\"approvedAt\":null,\"type\":\"vector\",\"attributes\":{\"url\":null,\"price\":\"8\",\"paymentUrl\":\"https://jakubhupka.lemonsqueezy.com/buy/e0b5b2fb-cfbc-4b4d-8c10-bbe16410eeb2\",\"vectorCount\":9,\"categories\":[{\"id\":\"65fa91ad-4375-40c0-8b72-1cc71f2f4000\",\"name\":\"Business\",\"slug\":\"business\"}]}},{\"id\":\"nSAlPybJ4g3ClbBPgiak\",\"resolved\":true,\"title\":\"LOAD Social Icons\",\"body\":\"\u003cp\u003eCarefully crafted vector icon set built specifically for Framer creators who care about clarity and consistency.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eYou’ll get \u003cstrong\u003e100+ popular social platform icons\u003c/strong\u003e, designed on a unified grid so everything feels balanced across headers, footers, profiles, and call-to-action sections. Every icon is fully vector, easy to resize, recolor, and customize without losing quality.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003eThis set is perfect for\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003ePersonal portfolios\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eStartup and SaaS websites\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eLanding pages and marketing sites\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eFooters, nav bars, and social sections \u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\",\"bodyJson\":null,\"introduction\":\"A polished set of 100+ social media icons designed for modern Framer websites. Clean, consistent, and ready to drop into any layout.\",\"slug\":\"load-social\",\"author\":{\"framerUserId\":\"f29fedd2-f269-4c3f-8efd-f358a9b5b523\",\"name\":\"Samuel G. Sumo\",\"slug\":\"samuelgsumo\",\"avatar\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/creators/504831/avatar-5rUejBtLzIe6h8OK3KDw53nb10md2v.jpg\",\"followed\":false,\"followsYou\":false},\"media\":[{\"type\":\"image\",\"url\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/vector-sets/load-social/6x64hann-LIaxgYcLtCAmjhYvLzEwDDlit6hdZS\",\"metadata\":{\"tint\":\"hsl(0 0% 57%)\",\"aspectRatio\":1.3333333333333333}},{\"type\":\"image\",\"url\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/vector-sets/load-social/qxjakon8-gGyR5lbfmSrjbckn6NNUzScPu4A8Re\",\"metadata\":{\"tint\":\"hsl(0 0% 3%)\",\"aspectRatio\":1.3333333333333333}},{\"type\":\"image\",\"url\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/vector-sets/load-social/vrglrhol-AzEPWyXOFH9xjoV3OBboAtOmUKyvdv\",\"metadata\":{\"tint\":\"hsl(0 0% 3%)\",\"aspectRatio\":1.3333333333333333}},{\"type\":\"image\",\"url\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/vector-sets/load-social/ps4ut0vm-Tt2wtdExYDgPBbFC2Fux9rDJxTAhVZ\",\"metadata\":{\"tint\":\"hsl(0 0% 3%)\",\"aspectRatio\":1.3333333333333333}}],\"post\":{\"id\":\"019bc820-f101-7f08-a0a3-3c554d3591c9\",\"bodyJson\":null,\"likes\":{\"count\":17,\"liked\":false},\"comments\":{\"count\":0},\"reposts\":{\"count\":0,\"reposted\":false,\"repostId\":null}},\"createdAt\":\"2026-01-15T00:36:23.621Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-05-25T05:23:33.450Z\",\"publishedAt\":\"2026-01-16T18:46:00.705Z\",\"featuredAt\":null,\"reported\":false,\"approvedAt\":null,\"type\":\"vector\",\"attributes\":{\"url\":\"https://framer.com/m/X-com-LdGQi0.js@DbC8BnenxSHgP0J9S5ug\",\"price\":null,\"paymentUrl\":null,\"vectorCount\":130,\"categories\":[{\"id\":\"1231f424-8c76-4fdf-bddf-80a8445a3ece\",\"name\":\"Social\",\"slug\":\"social\"}]}},{\"id\":\"jKxzclLjL9t8x84Zhi44\",\"resolved\":true,\"title\":\"social media icon\",\"body\":\"$6b\",\"bodyJson\":null,\"introduction\":\"A versatile collection of social media icons designed for web and app use, featuring original brand styles, solid color versions, and modern outline variations.\",\"slug\":\"social-media-icon\",\"author\":{\"framerUserId\":\"d67a3afc-95f0-4479-82cd-aa4897551262\",\"name\":\"zubayer alam\",\"slug\":\"zubayer-alam\",\"avatar\":\"https://framerusercontent.com/avatars/users/d67a3afc-95f0-4479-82cd-aa4897551262/qXR_PA0nx\",\"followed\":false,\"followsYou\":false},\"media\":[{\"type\":\"image\",\"url\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/vector-sets/social-media-icon/nl9j59ih-OJBxiafXwzWE8jRNHEvnF22SP9pGIB\",\"metadata\":{\"tint\":\"hsl(60 77% 34%)\",\"aspectRatio\":1.3333333333333333}},{\"type\":\"image\",\"url\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/vector-sets/social-media-icon/9qrx19k7-flNCtK8uJrt31NG2lpxqgumk0PiZ7X\",\"metadata\":{\"tint\":\"hsl(60 77% 34%)\",\"aspectRatio\":1.3333333333333333}}],\"post\":{\"id\":\"019b3631-b69a-7da0-affe-8fed51da2916\",\"bodyJson\":null,\"likes\":{\"count\":23,\"liked\":false},\"comments\":{\"count\":0},\"reposts\":{\"count\":0,\"reposted\":false,\"repostId\":null}},\"createdAt\":\"2025-12-06T10:21:39.534Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2025-12-19T10:39:46.330Z\",\"publishedAt\":\"2025-12-19T10:39:46.330Z\",\"featuredAt\":null,\"reported\":false,\"approvedAt\":null,\"type\":\"vector\",\"attributes\":{\"url\":\"https://framer.com/m/facebook-EVz7.js@4zlq6U6KriYSBvQ02hWP\",\"price\":null,\"paymentUrl\":null,\"vectorCount\":252,\"categories\":[{\"id\":\"1231f424-8c76-4fdf-bddf-80a8445a3ece\",\"name\":\"Social\",\"slug\":\"social\"}]}},{\"id\":\"p0Wsq7T8J5U5hYpT4syf\",\"resolved\":true,\"title\":\"Bloomix\",\"body\":\"\u003cp\u003eA collection of 40 carefully crafted glyph icons inspired by the beauty and diversity of flowers.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eFeaturing popular blooms such as Rose, Tulip, Orchid, Sunflower, Lily, Cherry Blossom, Hydrangea, Magnolia, and many more, each icon is designed with clean geometric shapes, balanced proportions, and a consistent visual style for a cohesive icon family.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eDesigned for modern digital products, these monochrome glyph icons are perfect for mobile apps, websites, design systems, presentations, branding, print materials, and creative projects.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eEvery icon is pixel-perfect, scalable, and optimized for professional workflows, making the collection a versatile asset for UI/UX designers, developers, content creators, and digital product teams.\u003c/p\u003e\",\"bodyJson\":{\"type\":\"doc\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"A collection of 40 carefully crafted glyph icons inspired by the beauty and diversity of flowers.\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Featuring popular blooms such as Rose, Tulip, Orchid, Sunflower, Lily, Cherry Blossom, Hydrangea, Magnolia, and many more, each icon is designed with clean geometric shapes, balanced proportions, and a consistent visual style for a cohesive icon family.\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Designed for modern digital products, these monochrome glyph icons are perfect for mobile apps, websites, design systems, presentations, branding, print materials, and creative projects.\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Every icon is pixel-perfect, scalable, and optimized for professional workflows, making the collection a versatile asset for UI/UX designers, developers, content creators, and digital product teams.\"}]}]},\"introduction\":\"Flower Glyph Icons\",\"slug\":\"bloomix\",\"author\":{\"framerUserId\":\"ad51ac17-dde0-437c-86d9-e5bdc209191c\",\"name\":\"Punloka\",\"slug\":\"punloka\",\"avatar\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/creators/504655/avatar-bptS8eULX4wdaiellNt7JHhPcQXSvh.jpg\",\"followed\":false,\"followsYou\":false},\"media\":[{\"type\":\"image\",\"url\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/media/ad51ac17-dde0-437c-86d9-e5bdc209191c/lite37r5\",\"metadata\":{\"tint\":\"hsl(180 17% 53%)\",\"aspectRatio\":1.3333333333333333}},{\"type\":\"image\",\"url\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/media/ad51ac17-dde0-437c-86d9-e5bdc209191c/vyy800lj\",\"metadata\":{\"tint\":\"hsl(180 17% 53%)\",\"aspectRatio\":1.3333333333333333}}],\"post\":{\"id\":\"019f162c-859a-7652-8f10-149105f4a3e4\",\"bodyJson\":null,\"likes\":{\"count\":5,\"liked\":false},\"comments\":{\"count\":0},\"reposts\":{\"count\":0,\"reposted\":false,\"repostId\":null}},\"createdAt\":\"2026-06-30T01:37:24.340Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-07-02T00:20:05.871Z\",\"publishedAt\":\"2026-06-30T01:37:24.334Z\",\"featuredAt\":null,\"reported\":false,\"approvedAt\":null,\"type\":\"vector\",\"attributes\":{\"url\":null,\"price\":\"4\",\"paymentUrl\":\"https://punloka.lemonsqueezy.com/checkout/buy/bfe3dd67-a00a-45ba-b73b-7306c2e8aab2\",\"vectorCount\":40,\"categories\":[{\"id\":\"89c679b1-87fd-4d3a-830c-c029d9c86011\",\"name\":\"Shapes\",\"slug\":\"shapes\"}]}},{\"id\":\"rq1KP8ROQ1oT7pznvEJJ\",\"resolved\":true,\"title\":\"Flower icon\",\"body\":\"\u003cp\u003eA vibrant collection of stylized flower and leaf icons in contrasting dark blue and green hues on a soft cream background fo