\",\"aspectRatio\":1.3333333333333333}},{\"type\":\"image\",\"url\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/vector-sets/moody/pp7zm9oh-3jyhRHTnj31ExCTh3JuY2vttu32Fyo\",\"metadata\":{\"tint\":\"hsl(260 77% 72%)\",\"aspectRatio\":1.3333333333333333}}],\"post\":{\"id\":\"019a0cd6-1f43-75ef-9dd7-af34921cf3f7\",\"bodyJson\":null,\"likes\":{\"count\":1,\"liked\":false},\"comments\":{\"count\":0},\"reposts\":{\"count\":0,\"reposted\":false,\"repostId\":null}},\"createdAt\":\"2025-10-17T20:18:22.780Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2025-11-15T11:07:56.056Z\",\"publishedAt\":\"2025-10-22T16:52:30.659Z\",\"featuredAt\":null,\"reported\":false,\"approvedAt\":null,\"type\":\"vector\",\"attributes\":{\"url\":null,\"price\":\"4\",\"paymentUrl\":\"https://payhip.com/b/VN6Oo\",\"vectorCount\":10,\"categories\":[{\"id\":\"78e55a4a-220e-474c-9a7f-690f940cb1de\",\"name\":\"Illustrations\",\"slug\":\"illustrations\"}]}},{\"id\":\"jJsYAgvqAWzdcUBOmSJC\",\"resolved\":true,\"title\":\"Mono Shapes Black\",\"body\":\"\u003cp\u003eThis Framer vector collection showcases a series of eight bold, black geometric shapes arranged in a clean, modern layout. Each shape explores balance and symmetry through minimal forms — from arches, semicircles, and domed rectangles to circles, squares, and abstract combinations.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe smooth edges and uniform fill give the set a sleek, contemporary aesthetic perfect for modern design systems, branding concepts, or motion graphics. These versatile shapes can be used individually as icons or merged to create unique compositions, adding structure and visual interest to any creative project.\u003c/p\u003e\",\"bodyJson\":null,\"introduction\":\"This Framer vector set features eight minimal geometric shapes in solid black - including arches, semicircles, rounded squares, and abstract forms. The collection combines simple, \",\"slug\":\"mono-shapes-black\",\"author\":{\"framerUserId\":\"f13b59d7-d12a-46db-a047-bb6329e9dcb9\",\"name\":\"Farzana Akter Anonna\",\"slug\":\"farzana-akter-anonna\",\"avatar\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/creators/1370108/a29b89341ccc7240596243edf34f4839-OyzxYSIx9tMbVOSb2kdKhwu56wJQru\",\"followed\":false,\"followsYou\":false},\"media\":[{\"type\":\"image\",\"url\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/vector-sets/mono-shapes-black/u5n8av0d-OU3WBvt75Fpt4WOEZ8Jp2JjYKqhAGt\",\"metadata\":{\"tint\":\"hsl(60 26% 47%)\",\"aspectRatio\":1.3333333333333333}},{\"type\":\"image\",\"url\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/vector-sets/mono-shapes-black/w5p9xpyk-06IaWbS8GDyuwLlRK4F45ZN9Nj28oL\",\"metadata\":{\"tint\":\"hsl(60 26% 47%)\",\"aspectRatio\":1.3333333333333333}}],\"post\":{\"id\":\"019a28ce-6b08-7fa5-a2e0-08d5228b5550\",\"bodyJson\":null,\"likes\":{\"count\":16,\"liked\":false},\"comments\":{\"count\":0},\"reposts\":{\"count\":0,\"reposted\":false,\"repostId\":null}},\"createdAt\":\"2025-10-11T07:09:06.535Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2025-10-28T03:13:27.816Z\",\"publishedAt\":\"2025-10-28T03:13:27.816Z\",\"featuredAt\":null,\"reported\":false,\"approvedAt\":null,\"type\":\"vector\",\"attributes\":{\"url\":\"https://framer.com/m/Shap-1-vur1.js@I8UH0cCqBwGJZM0ZM0Cw\",\"price\":null,\"paymentUrl\":null,\"vectorCount\":31,\"categories\":[{\"id\":\"89c679b1-87fd-4d3a-830c-c029d9c86011\",\"name\":\"Shapes\",\"slug\":\"shapes\"}]}},{\"id\":\"BSxVIFCqCzQZNv11D77e\",\"resolved\":true,\"title\":\"Magic Marker Icons\",\"body\":\"\u003cp\u003eThe “Magic Marker Icons” set is designed to bring a clean and approachable look to your Framer projects.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eEach icon features a bold line style for clarity and consistency.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eYou can easily customize two color variables — Primary and Secondary — to match your project’s tone. From UI and dashboards to portfolios and presentations, these icons offer flexibility and harmony wherever they’re used.\u003c/p\u003e\",\"bodyJson\":null,\"introduction\":\"A well-balanced and easy-to-use icon set. Simple and clear, yet flexible enough to adapt to a variety of projects through color customization.\",\"slug\":\"magic-marker-icons\",\"author\":{\"framerUserId\":\"d1dff73b-8bf5-4ebb-a23b-5332bada924d\",\"name\":\"日香理 / hikari\",\"slug\":\"hikari-template\",\"avatar\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/creators/492120/avatar-uytCLZVoEDDT5YrOh9eZuN2hFUQace.jpg\",\"followed\":false,\"followsYou\":false},\"media\":[{\"type\":\"image\",\"url\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/vector-sets/magic-marker-icons/zyrss1p5-WsD0APLn55VVXaQAhyo43sNAf3Hnp0\",\"metadata\":{\"tint\":\"hsl(0 0% 9%)\",\"aspectRatio\":1.3333333333333333}},{\"type\":\"image\",\"url\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/vector-sets/magic-marker-icons/44jqk2sy-RJ4rtz3vwernuLgwfKy8hsz9YJvqDN\",\"metadata\":{\"tint\":\"hsl(0 0% 9%)\",\"aspectRatio\":1.3333333333333333}},{\"type\":\"image\",\"url\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/vector-sets/magic-marker-icons/4jw2awfh-eI5KajaLapxNIalNv6pRmSY4QhCPRh\",\"metadata\":{\"tint\":\"hsl(0 0% 57%)\",\"aspectRatio\":1.3333333333333333}},{\"type\":\"image\",\"url\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/vector-sets/magic-marker-icons/smdqjf4v-wK9HlDrG6X4hBiMKrhbUayLIux9veV\",\"metadata\":{\"tint\":\"hsl(0 0% 57%)\",\"aspectRatio\":1.3333333333333333}}],\"post\":{\"id\":\"0199cd6c-3416-7fae-bef0-a459bc8980bd\",\"bodyJson\":null,\"likes\":{\"count\":14,\"liked\":false},\"comments\":{\"count\":0},\"reposts\":{\"count\":0,\"reposted\":false,\"repostId\":null}},\"createdAt\":\"2025-10-08T09:04:23.123Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2025-10-10T11:16:50.631Z\",\"publishedAt\":\"2025-10-10T09:20:44.566Z\",\"featuredAt\":null,\"reported\":false,\"approvedAt\":null,\"type\":\"vector\",\"attributes\":{\"url\":\"https://framer.com/m/Chat-B4fw.js@1FwTA0bnTwGgYQvRg4Kj\",\"price\":null,\"paymentUrl\":null,\"vectorCount\":42,\"categori